Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:56.71,ENG,1,0,0,0,,Onward, Ohauncey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.44,ENG,2,0,0,0,,To the highest room of the tallest tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:04.68,ENG,3,0,0,0,,...where my princess awaits rescue from her handsome Prince Oharming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:19.80,ENG,4,0,0,0,,This is worse than "Love Letters". I hate dinner theater!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.70,ENG,5,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.03,ENG,6,0,0,0,,Whoa there, Ohauncey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:29.90,ENG,7,0,0,0,,Hark! The brave Prince Oharming approacheth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:34.42,ENG,8,0,0,0,,Fear not, fair maiden. I shall slay the monster that guards you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:37.49,ENG,9,0,0,0,,...then take my place as rightful king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.22,ENG,10,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.40,ENG,11,0,0,0,,It's Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.33,ENG,12,0,0,0,,Whoo, Shrek, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:50.66,ENG,13,0,0,0,,Prepare, foul beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:55.47,ENG,14,0,0,0,,...to enter into a world of pain with which you are not familiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:58.17,ENG,15,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to thee Happy birthday to thee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:01:59.57,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:03.08,ENG,17,0,0,0,,Do you mind? Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.92,ENG,18,0,0,0,,Prepare, foul beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.63,ENG,19,0,0,0,,Someday you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:23.93,ENG,20,0,0,0,,We already are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.36,ENG,21,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.79,ENG,22,0,0,0,,You're right. I can't let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:02:59.97,ENG,23,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.91,ENG,24,0,0,0,,I am the rightful King of Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:07.14,ENG,25,0,0,0,,And I promise you this, Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:10.21,ENG,26,0,0,0,,...I will restore dignity to my throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.91,ENG,27,0,0,0,,And this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:20.22,ENG,28,0,0,0,,no one will stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.84,ENG,29,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.51,ENG,30,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:44.21,ENG,31,0,0,0,,Morning breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.51,ENG,32,0,0,0,,I know. Isn't it wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:50.02,ENG,33,0,0,0,,Good morning, good morning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:53.09,ENG,34,0,0,0,,The sun is shining through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.42,ENG,35,0,0,0,,Good morning, good morning To you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.69,ENG,36,0,0,0,,And you! And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.30,ENG,37,0,0,0,,They grow up so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:05.53,ENG,38,0,0,0,,Not fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:10.30,ENG,39,0,0,0,,You'll be filling in for the King and Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:13.64,ENG,40,0,0,0,,Several functions require your attendance, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:17.08,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Great! Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:20.05,ENG,42,0,0,0,,Oome on, lazybones. Time to get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:23.15,ENG,43,0,0,0,,You need to get a pair ofjammies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.83,ENG,44,0,0,0,,∮ I got some sleep and I needed it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.70,ENG,45,0,0,0,,∮ Not a lot, just a little bit ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.93,ENG,46,0,0,0,,∮ Someone's always trying to keep me from it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.91,ENG,47,0,0,0,,∮ It's a crying shame ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.94,ENG,48,0,0,0,,∮ It's a royal pain in the neck ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.74,ENG,49,0,0,0,,I knight thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.73,ENG,50,0,0,0,,If you're filling in for a king, you should look like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:15.93,ENG,51,0,0,0,,Oan somebody come in and work on Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.27,ENG,52,0,0,0,,I will see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.13,ENG,53,0,0,0,,Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:45.46,ENG,54,0,0,0,,Is this really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.90,ENG,55,0,0,0,,Quite necessary, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.84,ENG,56,0,0,0,,- I'm Shrek, you twit. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:54.67,ENG,57,0,0,0,,This isn't a rehearsal, peoples. Let's see some hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:56.75,ENG,58,0,0,0,,Smiles, everyone! Smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.34,ENG,59,0,0,0,,I don't know how much longer I can keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:03.42,ENG,60,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but can you just try to grin and bear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.58,ENG,61,0,0,0,,It's just until Dad gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.99,ENG,62,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.92,ENG,63,0,0,0,,You look handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.00,ENG,64,0,0,0,,Oome here, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:33.01,ENG,65,0,0,0,,My butt is itching up a storm and I can't reach it in this monkey suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:36.79,ENG,66,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Oome here. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.29,ENG,67,0,0,0,,Fiddlesworth, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:40.52,ENG,68,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.56,ENG,69,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.86,ENG,70,0,0,0,,...Princess Fiona and Sir Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:54.97,ENG,71,0,0,0,,Ahh! You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.63,ENG,72,0,0,0,,A little to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.07,ENG,73,0,0,0,,That's it! That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.31,ENG,74,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Scratch that thing! You're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.88,ENG,75,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:10.92,ENG,76,0,0,0,,My eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:12.22,ENG,77,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:19.79,ENG,78,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:26.13,ENG,79,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? - Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.08,ENG,80,0,0,0,,Shrimp! My favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.29,ENG,81,0,0,0,,- That's it! We're leaving! - Oalm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:50.36,ENG,82,0,0,0,,Oalm down? Who do you think we're kidding? I am an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:54.09,ENG,83,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for this, Fiona, and I never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.54,ENG,84,0,0,0,,I think that went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.90,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.77,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Oome on, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.51,ENG,87,0,0,0,,Some people just don't understand boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:20.39,ENG,88,0,0,0,,Just think. A couple more days and we'll be back home...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:23.83,ENG,89,0,0,0,,...in our vermin-filled shack strewn with fungus...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.87,ENG,90,0,0,0,,...and filled with the stench of mud and neglect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.63,ENG,91,0,0,0,,You had me at "vermin-filled".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:35.31,ENG,92,0,0,0,,And, um... maybe even the pitter-patter of little feet on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:38.51,ENG,93,0,0,0,,That's right, the swamp rats will be spawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.01,ENG,94,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:43.84,ENG,95,0,0,0,,What I'm thinking of is a little bigger than a swamp rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.01,ENG,96,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:48.81,ENG,97,0,0,0,,No, Shrek. What if, theoretically...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.22,ENG,98,0,0,0,,...they were little ogre feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:02.03,ENG,99,0,0,0,,Honey, let's be rational about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:04.53,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Have you seen a baby lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:07.87,ENG,101,0,0,0,,They just eat and poop, and they cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:11.38,ENG,102,0,0,0,,...then they cry when they poop and poop when they cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:14.31,ENG,103,0,0,0,,Now, imagine an ogre baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:18.25,ENG,104,0,0,0,,They extra-cry and they extra-poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:21.98,ENG,105,0,0,0,,Shrek, don't you ever think about having a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.68,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Right now, you're my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.86,ENG,107,0,0,0,,Somebody better be dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.03,ENG,108,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.53,ENG,109,0,0,0,,Harold?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:44.80,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Don't forget to pay the gardener, Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.88,ENG,111,0,0,0,,Of course, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:49.67,ENG,112,0,0,0,,Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:51.34,ENG,113,0,0,0,,Yes, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.21,ENG,114,0,0,0,,I know I made many mistakes with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.69,ENG,115,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.95,ENG,116,0,0,0,,But your love for Shrek has...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.29,ENG,117,0,0,0,,...taught me much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.42,ENG,118,0,0,0,,My dear boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:08.83,ENG,119,0,0,0,,...I am proud to call you my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:12.10,ENG,120,0,0,0,,And I'm proud to call you my frog...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.67,ENG,121,0,0,0,,...King dad-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:20.41,ENG,122,0,0,0,,Now there is a matter of business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.75,ENG,123,0,0,0,,The Frog King... is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.90,ENG,124,0,0,0,,Put your hat back on, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.63,ENG,125,0,0,0,,Shrek...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:47.43,ENG,126,0,0,0,,...please come hither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.64,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Yeah, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:55.94,ENG,128,0,0,0,,This kingdom needs a new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:01.95,ENG,129,0,0,0,,You and Fiona are next in line for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.82,ENG,130,0,0,0,,Next in line. You see, Dad, that's why people love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:11.29,ENG,131,0,0,0,,Even on your deathbed, you're still making jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:18.67,ENG,132,0,0,0,,Oome on, Dad. An ogre as king?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.33,ENG,133,0,0,0,,That's not such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:24.77,ENG,134,0,0,0,,There must be somebody else. Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:30.11,ENG,135,0,0,0,,Aside from you, there is only one remaining heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:33.45,ENG,136,0,0,0,,Really? Who is he, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.65,ENG,137,0,0,0,,His name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.08,ENG,138,0,0,0,,...is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.85,ENG,139,0,0,0,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.59,ENG,140,0,0,0,,...is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.59,ENG,141,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.82,ENG,142,0,0,0,,His name is Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.35,ENG,143,0,0,0,,Arthur?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:15.69,ENG,144,0,0,0,,I know you'll do...what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.06,ENG,145,0,0,0,,Harold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.76,ENG,146,0,0,0,,Dad? Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.43,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.63,ENG,148,0,0,0,,Do your thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:13:00.44,ENG,149,0,0,0,,∮ When you were young and your heart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.73,ENG,150,0,0,0,,∮ Was an open book ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.87,ENG,151,0,0,0,,∮ You used to say live and let live ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.35,ENG,152,0,0,0,,∮ You know you did, you know you did You know you did ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:18.22,ENG,153,0,0,0,,∮ But if this ever changing world In which we live in ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:23.26,ENG,154,0,0,0,,∮ Makes you give in and cry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:27.93,ENG,155,0,0,0,,∮ Say live and let die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.03,ENG,156,0,0,0,,∮ Live and let die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:13.31,ENG,157,0,0,0,,∮ Hey, lady You, lady ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.48,ENG,158,0,0,0,,∮ Cursing at your life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:19.81,ENG,159,0,0,0,,∮ You're a discontented mother ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:24.15,ENG,160,0,0,0,,∮ And a regimented wife ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:53.01,ENG,161,0,0,0,,What does a prince have to do to get a drink here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:56.05,ENG,162,0,0,0,,Ah, Mabel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:15:00.59,ENG,163,0,0,0,,Why they call you an ugly stepsister, I'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:04.79,ENG,164,0,0,0,,Where's Doris? Taking the night off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.70,ENG,165,0,0,0,,She's not welcome here, and neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:12.40,ENG,166,0,0,0,,What do you want, Oharming?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:16.60,ENG,167,0,0,0,,Not much. Just a chance at redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.68,ENG,168,0,0,0,,And a Fuzzy Navel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.87,ENG,169,0,0,0,,And Fuzzy Navels for all my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.95,ENG,170,0,0,0,,We're not your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.28,ENG,171,0,0,0,,You don't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:37.59,ENG,172,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, but, I mean, do any of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.36,ENG,173,0,0,0,,Do a number on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:44.10,ENG,174,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait! We are more alike than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.14,ENG,175,0,0,0,,Wicked Witch! The Seven Dwarfs saved Snow White, and what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:49.37,ENG,176,0,0,0,,Oh, what's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.77,ENG,177,0,0,0,,They left you the unfairest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:56.44,ENG,178,0,0,0,,Now here you are, hustling pool to get your next meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.41,ENG,179,0,0,0,,How does that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.48,ENG,180,0,0,0,,Pretty unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:07.02,ENG,181,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.79,ENG,182,0,0,0,,Your star puppet abandons the show to go and find his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.39,ENG,183,0,0,0,,I hate that little wooden puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.50,ENG,184,0,0,0,,And Hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.23,ENG,185,0,0,0,,Need I say more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.71,ENG,186,0,0,0,,- And you, Frumpypigskin! - Rumpelstiltskin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.47,ENG,187,0,0,0,,Where's that firstborn you were promised?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:34.79,ENG,188,0,0,0,,Mabel. Remember how you couldn't get your little fat foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:36.82,ENG,189,0,0,0,,...into that tiny glass slipper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:43.02,ENG,190,0,0,0,,Oinderella is in Far Far Away right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:48.32,ENG,191,0,0,0,,...eating bonbons, cavorting with every last fairy tale creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.80,ENG,192,0,0,0,,...that has ever done you wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:55.87,ENG,193,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, someone decided that we were the losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:58.88,ENG,194,0,0,0,,But there are two sides to every story...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:01.57,ENG,195,0,0,0,,...and our side has not been told!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:06.58,ENG,196,0,0,0,,So who will join me? Who wants to come out on top for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.38,ENG,197,0,0,0,,Who wants their...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.68,ENG,198,0,0,0,,"Happily ever after"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.54,ENG,199,0,0,0,,This way, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:46.92,ENG,200,0,0,0,,It's out of my hands, senorita. The winds of fate have blown on my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:50.86,ENG,201,0,0,0,,But I will never forget you. You are the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.43,ENG,202,0,0,0,,As are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.93,ENG,203,0,0,0,,And, uh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:59.23,ENG,204,0,0,0,,I don't know you, but I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.74,ENG,205,0,0,0,,I got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.84,ENG,206,0,0,0,,I don't wanna leave you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.81,ENG,207,0,0,0,,But you know how Shrek is. The dude's lost without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:12.08,ENG,208,0,0,0,,But don't worry. I'll send you airmail kisses every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:14.78,ENG,209,0,0,0,,Be strong, babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:17.36,ENG,210,0,0,0,,Ooco, Peanut, listen to your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:21.48,ENG,211,0,0,0,,Bananas, no roasting marshmallows on your sister's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.12,ENG,212,0,0,0,,That's my special boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:28.36,ENG,213,0,0,0,,Oome here, all of you! Give your daddy a big hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:36.27,ENG,214,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:41.58,ENG,215,0,0,0,,Maybe you should just stay and be King.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:45.24,ENG,216,0,0,0,,Oome on. There's no way I could run a kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:48.38,ENG,217,0,0,0,,That's why your cousin Arthur is a perfect choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:51.05,ENG,218,0,0,0,,It's not that. You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:55.65,ENG,219,0,0,0,,And if he gives me trouble, I always have persuasion and reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:59.13,ENG,220,0,0,0,,Here's persuasion... and here's reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:02.93,ENG,221,0,0,0,,Fiona...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:06.33,ENG,222,0,0,0,,...soon it's just going to be you, me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.13,ENG,223,0,0,0,,...and our swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.47,ENG,224,0,0,0,,It's not going to be just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:15.65,ENG,225,0,0,0,,All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.65,ENG,226,0,0,0,,It will be. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.31,ENG,227,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.48,ENG,228,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:30.59,ENG,229,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.32,ENG,230,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.10,ENG,231,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.54,ENG,232,0,0,0,,- Wait! - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.17,ENG,233,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:52.05,ENG,234,0,0,0,,I love you, too, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:55.02,ENG,235,0,0,0,,No! I said I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:19:59.46,ENG,236,0,0,0,,You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.03,ENG,237,0,0,0,,I said I'm pregnant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.67,ENG,238,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.86,ENG,239,0,0,0,,You're going to be a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.50,ENG,240,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.91,ENG,241,0,0,0,,Really? I'm glad you think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.44,ENG,242,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.57,ENG,243,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:24.05,ENG,244,0,0,0,,Me, too! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:31.41,ENG,245,0,0,0,,I'm going to be an uncle! I'm going to be an uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.62,ENG,246,0,0,0,,And you, my friend, are royally...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.32,ENG,247,0,0,0,,Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:27.94,ENG,248,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.61,ENG,249,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:36.95,ENG,250,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.57,ENG,251,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:03.65,ENG,252,0,0,0,,Better out than in, I always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.66,ENG,253,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.39,ENG,254,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.83,ENG,255,0,0,0,,Stop! Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:17.75,ENG,256,0,0,0,,Donkey. Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:19.12,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:22.89,ENG,258,0,0,0,,Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:27.32,ENG,259,0,0,0,,Shrek! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:34.60,ENG,260,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm going to be a father. How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:38.94,ENG,261,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain. When a man has feelings for a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:41.60,ENG,262,0,0,0,,...a powerful urge sweeps over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:44.24,ENG,263,0,0,0,,I know how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:47.14,ENG,264,0,0,0,,I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.75,ENG,265,0,0,0,,How does it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:04.03,ENG,266,0,0,0,,∮ And the cat's in the cradle and the silver spoon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:06.80,ENG,267,0,0,0,,∮ Little Boy Blue and the Man in the Moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:09.53,ENG,268,0,0,0,,∮ When you coming home, son? I don't know when ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:11.97,ENG,269,0,0,0,,∮ But we'll get together then, Dad ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:14.10,ENG,270,0,0,0,,Donkey! Oan you just cut to the part
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:16.77,ENG,271,0,0,0,,where you're supposed to make me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:20.04,ENG,272,0,0,0,,You know I love Fiona, boss. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:24.25,ENG,273,0,0,0,,What I am talking about is you, me, my cousin's boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:29.99,ENG,274,0,0,0,,...an ice cold pitcher of mojitos and two weeks of nothing but fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.13,0:24:31.99,ENG,275,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:34.83,ENG,276,0,0,0,,Having a baby isn't going to ruin your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:39.50,ENG,277,0,0,0,,It's not my life I'm worried about ruining, it's the kid's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:43.94,ENG,278,0,0,0,,When have you ever heard the phrase "as sweet as an ogre"...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.51,ENG,279,0,0,0,,...or "as nurturing as an ogre"...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:51.01,ENG,280,0,0,0,,...or "You'll love my dad. He's a real ogre."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.15,0:24:52.91,ENG,281,0,0,0,,Okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.05,0:24:56.51,ENG,282,0,0,0,,It's not going to be easy. But you got us to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.35,ENG,283,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.49,0:24:59.96,ENG,284,0,0,0,,I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:01.75,ENG,285,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:04.56,ENG,286,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.49,ENG,287,0,0,0,,Uh, with yourjourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:22.11,ENG,288,0,0,0,,"Wor-ces-ters-shiree"? Now that sounds fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:23.58,ENG,289,0,0,0,,It's Worcestershire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:25.55,ENG,290,0,0,0,,Like the sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.68,0:25:27.02,ENG,291,0,0,0,,It's spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:32.69,ENG,292,0,0,0,,They must be expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:41.40,ENG,293,0,0,0,,What in the shista-shire kind of place is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:46.73,ENG,294,0,0,0,,Well, my stomach aches and my palms just got sweaty. Must be a high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:48.03,ENG,295,0,0,0,,High school?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.17,0:25:49.73,ENG,296,0,0,0,,Ready? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:52.31,ENG,297,0,0,0,,Wherefore art thou headed, to the top?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.44,0:25:56.40,ENG,298,0,0,0,,Yeah, we think so, we think so! And dost thou thinkest thine can be stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.55,0:25:59.02,ENG,299,0,0,0,,Nay, we thinkst not, we thinkst not!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.29,0:26:08.28,ENG,300,0,0,0,,All right, Mr. Percival, ease up on the reins.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:15.33,ENG,301,0,0,0,,For lo, bro, don't burn all my frankincense and myrrh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:18.96,ENG,302,0,0,0,,I'm feeling nauseous from memories of wedgies and swirlies!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:23.77,ENG,303,0,0,0,,How did you receive wedgies when you are clearly not the wearer of underpants?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.91,0:26:26.81,ENG,304,0,0,0,,Let's just say some things are better left unsaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.95,0:26:31.01,ENG,305,0,0,0,,So I was all like, "I'd rather get the black plague than go out with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.15,0:26:33.48,ENG,306,0,0,0,,- Oh, totally. - Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.62,0:26:36.42,ENG,307,0,0,0,,- Totally ew-eth. - Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.02,0:26:40.62,ENG,308,0,0,0,,I just altered my character level to +3 superb-ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:43.32,ENG,309,0,0,0,,Hi. We're looking for someone named...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:47.99,ENG,310,0,0,0,,Who rolled a +9 dork spell and summoned the beast and his quadruped?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:54.33,ENG,311,0,0,0,,I know you're busy not fitting in, but can you tell me where I can find Arthur?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.47,0:26:55.77,ENG,312,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:20.36,ENG,313,0,0,0,,There is no sweeter taste on thy tongue than victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:25.67,ENG,314,0,0,0,,Strong, handsome, face of a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:29.14,ENG,315,0,0,0,,Does Arthur look like a king or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:31.64,ENG,316,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:35.01,ENG,317,0,0,0,,Did you say you were looking for Arthur?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.58,ENG,318,0,0,0,,That information is on a need-to-know basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.41,ENG,319,0,0,0,,It's top secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.55,0:27:43.15,ENG,320,0,0,0,,Now, gentlemen, let's away. To the showers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:47.28,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Greetings, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:48.98,ENG,322,0,0,0,,This is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.92,ENG,323,0,0,0,,What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.06,0:27:55.33,ENG,324,0,0,0,,Some kind of giant mutant leprechaun or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:59.83,ENG,325,0,0,0,,Giant mutant... You made a funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.34,0:28:02.27,ENG,326,0,0,0,,Unhand me, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:04.38,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Stop squirming, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:06.84,ENG,328,0,0,0,,I'm not Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:11.37,ENG,329,0,0,0,,I am Lancelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.18,ENG,330,0,0,0,,That dork over there is Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:22.45,ENG,331,0,0,0,,This is, like, totally embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.59,0:28:25.19,ENG,332,0,0,0,,...but Tiffany thinkest thou vex her so soothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.33,0:28:28.73,ENG,333,0,0,0,,She thought perchance thou would ask her to the Homecoming Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:29.96,ENG,334,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.10,0:28:34.04,ENG,335,0,0,0,,Like, whatever. She's into college guys and mythical creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:39.57,ENG,336,0,0,0,,Oh, Arthur...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.71,0:28:43.41,ENG,337,0,0,0,,...come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.45,0:28:48.08,ENG,338,0,0,0,,You better run, you little punk no-goodniks!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:51.62,ENG,339,0,0,0,,The days of Donkey Dumpy Drawers are over!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.06,ENG,340,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:01.79,ENG,341,0,0,0,,We're here for the mascot contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.47,0:29:09.67,ENG,342,0,0,0,,We're here for the mascot contest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.81,0:29:12.33,ENG,343,0,0,0,,This is a costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:14.47,ENG,344,0,0,0,,Worked on it all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.81,0:29:17.61,ENG,345,0,0,0,,Looks pretty real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:20.15,ENG,346,0,0,0,,If he were real, could I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.82,0:29:23.48,ENG,347,0,0,0,,Or this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.76,0:29:29.63,ENG,348,0,0,0,,If it were real, that would have been agonizingly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.96,ENG,349,0,0,0,,- Now watch this! - That's quite enough, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:38.43,ENG,350,0,0,0,,Thank you to Professor Primbottom and his lecture...on "just say nay".
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:43.64,ENG,351,0,0,0,,And now, without further ado, let's give a warm Worcestershire hoozah...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:47.27,ENG,352,0,0,0,,...to the winner of our mascot contest, the...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:49.44,ENG,353,0,0,0,,...ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:53.81,ENG,354,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm the new mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.95,0:29:57.58,ENG,355,0,0,0,,So let's really try and beat the other guys at...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:30:00.85,ENG,356,0,0,0,,...whatever it is they're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:07.39,ENG,357,0,0,0,,This is all a bit unorthodox...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:11.20,ENG,358,0,0,0,,Where can I find Arthur Pendragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:14.96,ENG,359,0,0,0,,Hey, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:20.70,ENG,360,0,0,0,,Olassic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:22.54,ENG,361,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:25.08,ENG,362,0,0,0,,I didn't do it. They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:31.62,ENG,363,0,0,0,,Please don't eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.76,0:30:34.09,ENG,364,0,0,0,,Eat him! Eat him! Eat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.76,ENG,365,0,0,0,,I'm not here to eat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.23,0:30:41.86,ENG,366,0,0,0,,Time to pack up your toothbrush and jammies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.00,0:30:44.23,ENG,367,0,0,0,,You're the new King of Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.37,0:30:46.03,ENG,368,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:51.77,ENG,369,0,0,0,,Artie a king? More like the Mayor of Loserville!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:57.50,ENG,370,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:02.25,ENG,371,0,0,0,,Is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:06.79,ENG,372,0,0,0,,Absolutely. Olean out your locker, kid. You have a kingdom to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:09.59,ENG,373,0,0,0,,So, wait... l'm really the only heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.93,0:31:12.26,ENG,374,0,0,0,,The one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:15.26,ENG,375,0,0,0,,Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:19.26,ENG,376,0,0,0,,My good people...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.40,0:31:22.13,ENG,377,0,0,0,,...there's a lesson here for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:26.57,ENG,378,0,0,0,,Next time you're about to dunk a kid's head in a chamber pot, stop and think,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.71,0:31:29.20,ENG,379,0,0,0,,"Hey, maybe this guy has feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:32.31,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Maybe I should cut him some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.45,0:31:35.82,ENG,381,0,0,0,,'Oause maybe... just maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:39.65,ENG,382,0,0,0,,...this guy's gonna turn out to be, I don't know, a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.79,0:31:44.82,ENG,383,0,0,0,,Maybe his first royal decree will be to banish everyone who ever picked on him."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:47.83,ENG,384,0,0,0,,I'm looking at you, jousting team!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.17,0:31:51.36,ENG,385,0,0,0,,And Guin? Oh, Guin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.57,ENG,386,0,0,0,,I've always loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.44,0:31:58.00,ENG,387,0,0,0,,Good friends, it breaks my heart, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:32:01.64,ENG,388,0,0,0,,...enjoy your stay here in prison while I rule the free world!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:03.37,ENG,389,0,0,0,,Okay, let's not overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:06.85,ENG,390,0,0,0,,I'm building my city, people... on rock 'n' roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.99,0:32:08.85,ENG,391,0,0,0,,You just overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:19.62,ENG,392,0,0,0,,Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.77,0:32:21.29,ENG,393,0,0,0,,You look darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:23.63,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Just precious. Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:26.14,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Any cravings since you got pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.27,0:32:28.90,ENG,396,0,0,0,,No. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.74,0:32:31.47,ENG,397,0,0,0,,Do you smell ham?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.61,0:32:34.74,ENG,398,0,0,0,,It's present time!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:40.68,ENG,399,0,0,0,,Fiona, please open mine first. It's the one in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:45.45,ENG,400,0,0,0,,"Oongratulations on your new mess mak..." Oh, mess maker!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:48.58,ENG,401,0,0,0,,"Hopefully this helps. Love, Oinderella."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.93,0:32:51.59,ENG,402,0,0,0,,- Look at that! - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.17,0:32:55.63,ENG,403,0,0,0,,It's for the poopies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.77,0:32:57.33,ENG,404,0,0,0,,Wait... babies poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.47,0:32:58.80,ENG,405,0,0,0,,Everyone poops, Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.94,0:33:00.40,ENG,406,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.37,ENG,407,0,0,0,,We all chipped in for a little present, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.28,0:33:05.83,ENG,408,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.05,0:33:09.88,ENG,409,0,0,0,,You know the baby will love it, because I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:12.98,ENG,410,0,0,0,,Guys, that's so sweet. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.52,ENG,411,0,0,0,,Who's this one from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.65,0:33:17.59,ENG,412,0,0,0,,I got you the biggest one, because I love you most.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:20.78,ENG,413,0,0,0,,"Have one on me. Love, Snow White."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.63,0:33:25.26,ENG,414,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:26.92,ENG,415,0,0,0,,He's a live-in babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:28.16,ENG,416,0,0,0,,Where's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.30,0:33:32.36,ENG,417,0,0,0,,You're too kind, Snow, but I can't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.50,0:33:34.87,ENG,418,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I have six more at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:36.77,ENG,419,0,0,0,,- What does he do? - Oleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.91,0:33:38.50,ENG,420,0,0,0,,- Feeding. - Burping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.64,0:33:41.11,ENG,421,0,0,0,,So, what are Shrek and I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:43.37,ENG,422,0,0,0,,Work on your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:47.38,ENG,423,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rapunzel. What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.52,0:33:51.55,ENG,424,0,0,0,,Oome on now, Fiona. You know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.49,0:33:54.52,ENG,425,0,0,0,,You're tired all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.66,0:33:56.39,ENG,426,0,0,0,,You start letting yourself go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:57.69,ENG,427,0,0,0,,Stretch marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.83,0:33:59.16,ENG,428,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:04.94,ENG,429,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but how many of you have kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.07,0:34:06.63,ENG,430,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.77,0:34:11.21,ENG,431,0,0,0,,A baby will only strengthen the love Shrek and Fiona have.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:14.18,ENG,432,0,0,0,,How did Shrek react when you told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.35,0:34:18.51,ENG,433,0,0,0,,When he first found out, Shrek said...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:35.70,ENG,434,0,0,0,,Onward, my new friends! To our happily ever afters!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.37,0:34:43.53,ENG,435,0,0,0,,Now... bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.06,0:35:02.93,ENG,436,0,0,0,,Well, well, well. If it isn't Peter Pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:05.53,ENG,437,0,0,0,,- His name's not Peter. - Shut it, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:27.75,ENG,438,0,0,0,,Enough pillaging! To the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.57,ENG,439,0,0,0,,You go! Take care of the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.71,0:35:50.87,ENG,440,0,0,0,,Everybody stay calm! We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:35:57.41,ENG,441,0,0,0,,Everyone in! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.55,0:35:59.68,ENG,442,0,0,0,,Oome on! Put some back into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:04.51,ENG,443,0,0,0,,We don't have time. Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:06.45,ENG,444,0,0,0,,Quickly, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:10.29,ENG,445,0,0,0,,We'll hold them off as long as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.98,0:36:28.38,ENG,446,0,0,0,,Where are Shrek and Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.51,0:36:30.67,ENG,447,0,0,0,,The name doesn't ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.82,0:36:32.51,ENG,448,0,0,0,,No bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.65,0:36:36.02,ENG,449,0,0,0,,I suggest you freaks cooperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:38.75,ENG,450,0,0,0,,...with the new King of Far Far Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.89,0:36:42.59,ENG,451,0,0,0,,The only thing you're ever gonna be king of is King of the Stupids!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.73,0:36:45.03,ENG,452,0,0,0,,- Hook! - Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.16,0:36:47.39,ENG,453,0,0,0,,Avast, ye cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.00,0:36:51.66,ENG,454,0,0,0,,Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:57.53,ENG,455,0,0,0,,- Gingy! - Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.04,ENG,456,0,0,0,,Settle down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.02,0:37:16.32,ENG,457,0,0,0,,On the good ship Lollipop
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.46,0:37:19.90,ENG,458,0,0,0,,It's a sweet trip to the candy shop
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.03,0:37:21.02,ENG,459,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:24.06,ENG,460,0,0,0,,You can't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.20,0:37:27.87,ENG,461,0,0,0,,So tell me, puppet... where is Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.88,0:37:34.11,ENG,462,0,0,0,,Well... I don't know where he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.44,ENG,463,0,0,0,,You don't know where Shrek is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.58,0:37:39.18,ENG,464,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be inaccurate to assume...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.32,0:37:43.58,ENG,465,0,0,0,,...that I couldn't exactly not say that is or isn't almost partially incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.72,0:37:45.09,ENG,466,0,0,0,,So you do know where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:47.75,ENG,467,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I'm possibly more or less
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:53.92,ENG,468,0,0,0,,not definitely rejecting the idea that in no way, with any amount of uncertainty...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:55.05,ENG,469,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.33,ENG,470,0,0,0,,...I do not know where he shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.47,0:37:59.94,ENG,471,0,0,0,,If that indeed wasn't where he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.67,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Even if he wasn't not where I knew he was, it could mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:06.04,ENG,473,0,0,0,,On the good ship Lollipop
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.18,0:38:10.58,ENG,474,0,0,0,,Enough! Shrek went off to bring back the next heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.59,0:38:15.38,ENG,475,0,0,0,,He's bringing back the next heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.52,0:38:17.01,ENG,476,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:21.45,ENG,477,0,0,0,,Hook! Get rid of this new "King".
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:23.46,ENG,478,0,0,0,,But bring Shrek to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:26.79,ENG,479,0,0,0,,I have something special in mind for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.93,0:38:29.09,ENG,480,0,0,0,,He'll never fall for your tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.77,0:38:32.43,ENG,481,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:45.31,ENG,482,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. Me, a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.45,0:38:48.48,ENG,483,0,0,0,,I knew I came from royalty, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:50.71,ENG,484,0,0,0,,...I figured everyone forgot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.86,0:38:54.59,ENG,485,0,0,0,,Oh, no. In fact the King asked for you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.73,0:38:57.29,ENG,486,0,0,0,,Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.63,0:39:00.86,ENG,487,0,0,0,,But I know it's not all fun and games.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:03.99,ENG,488,0,0,0,,It really is all fun and games, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:07.73,ENG,489,0,0,0,,Sure, you have to knight a few heroes, launch a ship or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:12.21,ENG,490,0,0,0,,By the way, make sure you hit the boat just right with the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.34,0:39:15.14,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Any idiot can hit a boat with a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.98,0:39:18.92,ENG,492,0,0,0,,Well, I've heard it's harder than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:21.02,ENG,493,0,0,0,,This is going to be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:26.02,ENG,494,0,0,0,,Parties, princesses, castles. Princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:29.02,ENG,495,0,0,0,,You'll be living in the lap of luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:31.63,ENG,496,0,0,0,,The finest chefs will wait for your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.76,0:39:34.73,ENG,497,0,0,0,,And fortunately, you'll have the royal food tasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.56,ENG,498,0,0,0,,What do they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:41.30,ENG,499,0,0,0,,Taste the food before the King eats, to make sure it's not poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.44,0:39:44.03,ENG,500,0,0,0,,- Poisoned? - Or too salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.18,0:39:47.70,ENG,501,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Your bodyguards will keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.85,0:39:50.11,ENG,502,0,0,0,,All of them willing at a moment's notice
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.25,0:39:53.08,ENG,503,0,0,0,,to lay down their lives out of devotion to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.22,0:39:54.65,ENG,504,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.79,0:39:57.81,ENG,505,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom will look to you for wisdom and guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.19,0:40:00.12,ENG,506,0,0,0,,Make sure they don't die of famine!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:01.99,ENG,507,0,0,0,,- Or plague. - Plague is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:05.03,ENG,508,0,0,0,,The coughing, the groaning, the festering sores.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.60,0:40:11.04,ENG,509,0,0,0,,Festering sores! You are one funny kitty cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:13.10,ENG,510,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.24,0:40:15.60,ENG,511,0,0,0,,We don't want Artie getting the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.37,0:40:17.53,ENG,512,0,0,0,,Artie?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.81,0:40:23.58,ENG,513,0,0,0,,There goes my hip!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.72,0:40:25.88,ENG,514,0,0,0,,Artie! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.82,0:40:29.95,ENG,515,0,0,0,,What does it look like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.62,0:40:35.09,ENG,516,0,0,0,,This really isn't up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.23,0:40:38.09,ENG,517,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about being king!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:40.16,ENG,518,0,0,0,,You'll learn on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.07,0:40:44.59,ENG,519,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:47.17,ENG,520,0,0,0,,Back to what? Being a loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.74,0:40:52.30,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Now look what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:56.91,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Look what I did? Who's holding the wheel, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:40:59.41,ENG,523,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.76,0:41:13.75,ENG,524,0,0,0,,Land ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:28.11,ENG,525,0,0,0,,How humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:32.05,ENG,526,0,0,0,,Oh, nice going, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.18,0:41:35.88,ENG,527,0,0,0,,Now it's "Your Highness"? What happened to "loser"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:38.92,ENG,528,0,0,0,,If you think this is getting you out of anything, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.06,0:41:42.82,ENG,529,0,0,0,,We're heading back to Far Far Away one way or another...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.96,0:41:45.40,ENG,530,0,0,0,,...and you're going to be a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.53,0:41:46.96,ENG,531,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.80,0:41:49.36,ENG,532,0,0,0,,You just said "father".
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:52.23,ENG,533,0,0,0,,King! You're going to be king!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.37,0:41:55.36,ENG,534,0,0,0,,"You're going to be king!" Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.57,0:41:58.01,ENG,535,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.14,0:42:00.61,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Far Far Away... from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.75,0:42:02.71,ENG,537,0,0,0,,Get back here, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.68,0:42:07.17,ENG,538,0,0,0,,Boss? I don't think he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.32,0:42:10.52,ENG,539,0,0,0,,Maybe it's for the best. He's not exactly king material.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.66,0:42:13.89,ENG,540,0,0,0,,When did you plan to tell him you were supposed to be king?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:16.86,ENG,541,0,0,0,,Oome on. Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.00,0:42:20.06,ENG,542,0,0,0,,Besides, he'll be ten times better at it than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:24.16,ENG,543,0,0,0,,Then change your tactics if you want to get anywhere with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.50,0:42:28.34,ENG,544,0,0,0,,You're right, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:32.20,ENG,545,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.34,0:42:36.18,ENG,546,0,0,0,,- Shrek! - Oome on. It's just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.75,0:42:39.08,ENG,547,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.87,0:42:57.53,ENG,548,0,0,0,,Listen, Artie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.10,0:43:03.23,ENG,549,0,0,0,,If you think this whole mad scene ain't dope, I feel you, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.37,0:43:07.50,ENG,550,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to get up in your grill or raise your roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.65,0:43:09.77,ENG,551,0,0,0,,But what I am screamin' is, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.91,0:43:13.11,ENG,552,0,0,0,,...check out this kazing thazing, bazaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.25,0:43:15.34,ENG,553,0,0,0,,If it doesn't groove, or what I'm saying
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:18.42,ENG,554,0,0,0,,ain't straight trippin', say, "Oh, no, you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.56,0:43:20.99,ENG,555,0,0,0,,You're getting on my last nerve."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.13,0:43:24.12,ENG,556,0,0,0,,And then I'll know it's... I'll know it's wack!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.73,0:43:26.92,ENG,557,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.07,0:43:30.47,ENG,558,0,0,0,,I've been kidnapped by a monster who's trying to relate to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:34.23,ENG,559,0,0,0,,- Artie, wait. - Oome on! Help! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.74,0:43:39.44,ENG,560,0,0,0,,Greetings, cosmic children of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.58,0:43:41.51,ENG,561,0,0,0,,Welcome to my serenity circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.65,0:43:45.78,ENG,562,0,0,0,,Please leave any bad vibes outside the healing vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.92,0:43:47.75,ENG,563,0,0,0,,Now prepare to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.42,0:43:56.26,ENG,564,0,0,0,,I knew I should have got that warranty!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.16,0:44:00.63,ENG,565,0,0,0,,Mr. Merlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.77,0:44:02.23,ENG,566,0,0,0,,You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.37,0:44:06.63,ENG,567,0,0,0,,Yeah. He was the school magic teacher, until he had his nervous breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.77,0:44:10.14,ENG,568,0,0,0,,Technically, I was merely a victim of a level 3 fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.27,0:44:12.37,ENG,569,0,0,0,,At the request of my therapist,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.51,0:44:16.14,ENG,570,0,0,0,,and the school authorities, I retired to the tranquility of nature
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:18.44,ENG,571,0,0,0,,to discover my divine purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.95,0:44:23.35,ENG,572,0,0,0,,Oan I interest anyone in a snack or beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:24.58,ENG,573,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:28.06,ENG,574,0,0,0,,Sure you don't want to try my Rock Au Gratin?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:32.43,ENG,575,0,0,0,,It's organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.56,0:44:35.00,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Thanks. I ate a boulder on the way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.13,0:44:38.07,ENG,577,0,0,0,,We need directions to Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:40.73,ENG,578,0,0,0,,"We"? Who said I was going with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.87,0:44:45.24,ENG,579,0,0,0,,I did. People are counting on you, so don't try to weasel out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.38,0:44:47.44,ENG,580,0,0,0,,If the job's so great, you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.98,0:44:52.25,ENG,581,0,0,0,,Understand this, kid. No more Mr. Nice Guy from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.38,0:44:54.68,ENG,582,0,0,0,,That was your Mr. Nice Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.82,0:44:56.75,ENG,583,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I'm going to miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.89,0:45:01.29,ENG,584,0,0,0,,Why don't you go terrorize a village and leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:05.95,ENG,585,0,0,0,,Was that a crack about ogres? You get your royal highness to Far Far Away...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.10,0:45:10.12,ENG,586,0,0,0,,...before I kick it there! Now, which way am I kicking?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.27,0:45:12.10,ENG,587,0,0,0,,I could tell you, but since you're
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:14.76,ENG,588,0,0,0,,in the midst of a self-destructive rage spiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.91,0:45:17.43,ENG,589,0,0,0,,it would be karmically irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.58,0:45:21.24,ENG,590,0,0,0,,Self-destructive? Are you going to help us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.38,0:45:23.97,ENG,591,0,0,0,,Most definitely, but only after you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.12,0:45:27.31,ENG,592,0,0,0,,take the journey to your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.45,0:45:28.82,ENG,593,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.95,0:45:32.79,ENG,594,0,0,0,,It's either that or primal scream therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.86,0:45:37.52,ENG,595,0,0,0,,All right. Journey to the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:40.23,ENG,596,0,0,0,,Now, all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:42.89,ENG,597,0,0,0,,look into the Fire of Truth
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.03,0:45:46.03,ENG,598,0,0,0,,and tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:50.74,ENG,599,0,0,0,,Ooh, charades!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.88,0:45:55.64,ENG,600,0,0,0,,Okay, I see a Dutch fudge torte with cinnamon swirls!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.78,0:45:58.37,ENG,601,0,0,0,,Okay, monster... go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.06,0:46:08.75,ENG,602,0,0,0,,I see a rainbow pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.89,0:46:10.83,ENG,603,0,0,0,,Excellent work! Now the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.96,0:46:12.43,ENG,604,0,0,0,,This is lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:14.83,ENG,605,0,0,0,,You're lame! Now just go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.40,0:46:17.73,ENG,606,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.57,0:46:23.01,ENG,607,0,0,0,,There's a baby bird and a father bird sitting in a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.14,0:46:25.13,ENG,608,0,0,0,,Yes! Stay with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.98,0:46:29.97,ENG,609,0,0,0,,The dad just flew away. Why did he leave the little bird all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.65,0:46:34.08,ENG,610,0,0,0,,It's trying to fly, but it doesn't know how to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.99,0:46:37.15,ENG,611,0,0,0,,It's going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.99,0:46:45.99,ENG,612,0,0,0,,Proper head case you are. Really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.33,0:46:54.33,ENG,613,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it. The bird's me. My dad left. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.35,0:47:09.01,ENG,614,0,0,0,,Look, Artie, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.36,0:47:16.12,ENG,615,0,0,0,,Just thought I'd help set the mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.26,0:47:19.59,ENG,616,0,0,0,,...for your big heart-to-heart chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.04,0:47:31.37,ENG,617,0,0,0,,I know what it's like to not feel ready for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.71,0:47:36.04,ENG,618,0,0,0,,Even ogres get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.88,0:47:39.71,ENG,619,0,0,0,,You know... once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.72,0:47:45.49,ENG,620,0,0,0,,I know you want me to be king, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.62,0:47:48.49,ENG,621,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for it, and I never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.39,0:47:51.88,ENG,622,0,0,0,,Even my own dad knew I wasn't worth the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.03,0:47:55.23,ENG,623,0,0,0,,He dumped me at that school first chance he got...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.90,0:47:58.23,ENG,624,0,0,0,,...and I never heard from him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.90,0:48:03.74,ENG,625,0,0,0,,My dad wasn't really the fatherly type, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.40,ENG,626,0,0,0,,I doubt he was worse than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:08.54,ENG,627,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.68,0:48:12.74,ENG,628,0,0,0,,My father was an ogre. He tried to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.58,0:48:15.78,ENG,629,0,0,0,,I guess I should have realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.92,0:48:20.19,ENG,630,0,0,0,,He bathed me in barbecue sauce and put me to bed with an apple in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.09,0:48:24.58,ENG,631,0,0,0,,I guess that's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:29.13,ENG,632,0,0,0,,It may be hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.27,0:48:32.72,ENG,633,0,0,0,,what, with my obvious charm and good looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.87,0:48:35.81,ENG,634,0,0,0,,but people used to think I was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.94,0:48:39.60,ENG,635,0,0,0,,And for a long time, I believed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.61,0:48:43.20,ENG,636,0,0,0,,But after a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.35,0:48:46.87,ENG,637,0,0,0,,you learn to ignore the names people call you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.02,0:48:49.35,ENG,638,0,0,0,,and just trust who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.46,0:48:54.62,ENG,639,0,0,0,,You know... you're okay, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.46,0:48:59.02,ENG,640,0,0,0,,You just need to do a little less yelling and use a little more soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:01.99,ENG,641,0,0,0,,Thanks, Artie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.13,0:49:05.80,ENG,642,0,0,0,,The soap's because you stink... really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.97,0:49:09.46,ENG,643,0,0,0,,Yeah... I got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.48,0:49:16.34,ENG,644,0,0,0,,This place is filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.65,0:49:18.24,ENG,645,0,0,0,,I feel like a hobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:22.25,ENG,646,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this isn't working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.39,0:49:26.95,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Everything's always about you. It's not like your attitude is helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.09,0:49:30.79,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Maybe itjust bothers you I was voted fairest in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.93,0:49:33.02,ENG,649,0,0,0,,You mean in that rigged election?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:36.13,ENG,650,0,0,0,,Give me a break. "Rapunzel, Rapunzel...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.27,0:49:39.40,ENG,651,0,0,0,,...let down thy golden extensions!"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.54,0:49:44.34,ENG,652,0,0,0,,Ladies, let go of your petty complaints and let's work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.31,0:49:50.30,ENG,653,0,0,0,,So I guess the plan is we just wander aimlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:52.54,ENG,654,0,0,0,,in this stinkhole until we rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.68,0:49:56.21,ENG,655,0,0,0,,No, we get inside and find out what Oharming's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.35,0:49:59.05,ENG,656,0,0,0,,I know he's a jerk and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.19,0:50:03.35,ENG,657,0,0,0,,but that Oharming makes me hotter than July.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.70,0:50:06.03,ENG,658,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.06,0:50:36.42,ENG,659,0,0,0,,Oome on! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.56,0:50:37.55,ENG,660,0,0,0,,Rapunzel, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.07,0:50:48.90,ENG,661,0,0,0,,Oharming, let go of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:51.67,ENG,662,0,0,0,,But why would I want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.21,0:50:58.20,ENG,663,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.35,0:51:03.45,ENG,664,0,0,0,,Say hello, ladies, to the new Queen of Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.46,0:51:09.26,ENG,665,0,0,0,,Rapunzel, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.39,0:51:11.66,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Jealous much?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.80,0:51:14.23,ENG,667,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be back where you started,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.37,0:51:16.99,ENG,668,0,0,0,,scrubbing floors or locked away in towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.13,0:51:20.76,ENG,669,0,0,0,,That is, if I let you last the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.07,0:51:25.67,ENG,670,0,0,0,,Pookie, you promised not to hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.81,0:51:29.80,ENG,671,0,0,0,,Not here, kitten whiskers. Daddy will discuss it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:33.07,ENG,672,0,0,0,,Now forgive us. We have a show to put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.22,0:51:36.48,ENG,673,0,0,0,,Shrek will be back soon, and you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.62,0:51:38.02,ENG,674,0,0,0,,Sorry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.16,0:51:42.42,ENG,675,0,0,0,,Don't you realize once Shrek sets foot in Far Far Away...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:44.32,ENG,676,0,0,0,,...he's doomed?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.87,0:52:25.49,ENG,677,0,0,0,,Look out! They got a piano!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.64,0:52:29.00,ENG,678,0,0,0,,Kill them all... except the fat one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.14,0:52:33.51,ENG,679,0,0,0,,King Oharming has something special in mind for you, ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.64,0:52:34.94,ENG,680,0,0,0,,King Oharming?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:36.10,ENG,681,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.39,0:52:43.55,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Artie, duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.10,0:52:59.36,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Ready the plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.09,0:53:16.75,ENG,684,0,0,0,,- Shrek! - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.07,0:53:37.37,ENG,685,0,0,0,,Oowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.51,0:53:39.87,ENG,686,0,0,0,,What has Oharming done with Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.01,0:53:42.60,ENG,687,0,0,0,,She's going to get what's coming to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.18,0:53:48.08,ENG,688,0,0,0,,And there ain't nothing you can do to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.22,0:53:50.74,ENG,689,0,0,0,,- We've got to save her. - But she's so far far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.69,0:53:53.99,ENG,690,0,0,0,,Get yourself back to Worcestershire, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.12,0:53:57.62,ENG,691,0,0,0,,No, Shrek. Hold on. I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.76,0:54:00.03,ENG,692,0,0,0,,I am a buzzing bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.70,0:54:03.90,ENG,693,0,0,0,,Mr. Merlin? They need a spell to get them...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:07.06,ENG,694,0,0,0,,...I mean us, back to Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.20,0:54:10.64,ENG,695,0,0,0,,Forget it. I don't have that kind of magic in me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.77,0:54:14.47,ENG,696,0,0,0,,How about a hug? That's the best kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.61,0:54:16.98,ENG,697,0,0,0,,Please. I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:18.91,ENG,698,0,0,0,,I said forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.05,0:54:20.38,ENG,699,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:29.38,ENG,700,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:33.89,ENG,701,0,0,0,,It's just so hard, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:38.70,ENG,702,0,0,0,,They need to get back, 'cause their kingdom's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.84,0:54:41.36,ENG,703,0,0,0,,'Oause there's a really bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.51,0:54:43.27,ENG,704,0,0,0,,It's just so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.41,0:54:45.53,ENG,705,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:49.04,ENG,706,0,0,0,,No! I don't think you understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.18,0:54:53.71,ENG,707,0,0,0,,There's a mean person doing mean things to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:55.55,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Have a heart, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.69,0:54:59.85,ENG,709,0,0,0,,They really need your help to get back. Why won't you help them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.69,0:55:05.29,ENG,710,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:07.42,ENG,711,0,0,0,,I'll go get my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.20,0:55:11.39,ENG,712,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.54,0:55:15.06,ENG,713,0,0,0,,Well, well. You want eggs with that ham?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.21,0:55:18.90,ENG,714,0,0,0,,I am a little rusty, so there could be some side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.04,0:55:20.51,ENG,715,0,0,0,,- Side effects? - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.64,0:55:24.41,ENG,716,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, no matter how excruciatingly painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.55,0:55:27.71,ENG,717,0,0,0,,it will wear off eventually. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.69,0:55:31.92,ENG,718,0,0,0,,- Oops. - You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.06,0:55:36.19,ENG,719,0,0,0,,If Artie trusts him, that's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.33,0:55:38.19,ENG,720,0,0,0,,Even if his robe doesn't cover...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.33,0:55:40.85,ENG,721,0,0,0,,Alacritious expeditious...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.00,0:55:43.69,ENG,722,0,0,0,,...a-zoomy-zoom-zoom!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.83,0:55:46.67,ENG,723,0,0,0,,Let's help our friends get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.41,0:55:50.74,ENG,724,0,0,0,,...soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.08,0:55:59.67,ENG,725,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:11.42,ENG,726,0,0,0,,I haven't been on a trip like that since college!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.86,0:56:13.12,ENG,727,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:16.10,ENG,728,0,0,0,,What? Is something in my teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.54,0:56:23.53,ENG,729,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I've been abracadabra-ed into a Fancy Feastin', second-rate sidekick!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.88,0:56:29.94,ENG,730,0,0,0,,At least you don't look like some kind of bloated pinata!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.08,0:56:32.14,ENG,731,0,0,0,,You should think about going on a diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:36.88,ENG,732,0,0,0,,You should get yourself a pair of pants. I feel all exposed and nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.56,0:56:40.89,ENG,733,0,0,0,,So you two think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.39,0:56:45.19,ENG,734,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.33,0:56:47.80,ENG,735,0,0,0,,Don't be. You got us back, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:55.60,ENG,736,0,0,0,,How in the Hans Ohristian Andersen
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.74,0:56:58.50,ENG,737,0,0,0,,am I supposed to parade around in these goofy boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.64,0:57:01.48,ENG,738,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Be very careful with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.91,0:57:06.25,ENG,739,0,0,0,,They were made in Madrid by the finest...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:08.91,ENG,740,0,0,0,,You'll learn to control that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.82,0:57:16.82,ENG,741,0,0,0,,Seriously. Ow! You need some comfort inserts or arch supports or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:27.87,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Watch it. I'm walking here and I'm gonna keep going until...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.01,0:57:29.10,ENG,743,0,0,0,,Pinocchio!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.84,0:57:31.87,ENG,744,0,0,0,,Shrek! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:35.21,ENG,745,0,0,0,,- What happened? - Oharming and the villains took over!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.35,0:57:39.11,ENG,746,0,0,0,,Fiona and the Princesses got away. Now she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.25,0:57:40.77,ENG,747,0,0,0,,She's what?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:44.95,ENG,748,0,0,0,,Puss! Loan me five bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.09,0:57:47.32,ENG,749,0,0,0,,You heard him. Help the brother out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.46,0:57:49.55,ENG,750,0,0,0,,Do you see any pockets on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.69,0:57:51.52,ENG,751,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.03,0:57:58.20,ENG,752,0,0,0,,I had no idea, really. I... I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.37,0:58:01.56,ENG,753,0,0,0,,Quick! Where is Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.71,0:58:05.47,ENG,754,0,0,0,,Oharming has her locked away someplace. You have to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:08.48,ENG,755,0,0,0,,He's probably getting ready for the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.61,0:58:10.94,ENG,756,0,0,0,,Wait, Pinocchio! What show?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.95,0:58:18.35,ENG,757,0,0,0,,"It's a Happily Ever After After All".
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.82,ENG,758,0,0,0,,"Shrek's final performance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.96,0:58:25.09,ENG,759,0,0,0,,Shrek! You didn't tell us you were in a play!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.23,0:58:28.69,ENG,760,0,0,0,,I guess I've been so busy I forgot to mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.83,0:58:30.39,ENG,761,0,0,0,,The ogre! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.74,0:58:34.07,ENG,762,0,0,0,,Don't worry, jefe. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.61,0:58:42.24,ENG,763,0,0,0,,Uck! Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.25,0:58:48.38,ENG,764,0,0,0,,Look. Don't you know who he thinks he is? How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:50.04,ENG,765,0,0,0,,We're dealing with amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:55.12,ENG,766,0,0,0,,He's a star, people! Hello? I'm so sorry about this, Mr. Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.26,0:58:56.78,ENG,767,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.93,0:59:00.73,ENG,768,0,0,0,,Is everything ready? You did get the list for the dressing room?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.86,0:59:03.96,ENG,769,0,0,0,,Breakfast croissant stuffed with seared sashimi tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.10,0:59:07.40,ENG,770,0,0,0,,And I hope you have the saffron corn with jalapeno honey butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.54,0:59:10.53,ENG,771,0,0,0,,Our client cannot get into his proper emotional state
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.67,0:59:12.47,ENG,772,0,0,0,,withoutjalapeno honey butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.61,0:59:14.01,ENG,773,0,0,0,,I just lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.78,0:59:17.30,ENG,774,0,0,0,,They should talk to Nancy in Human Resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.45,0:59:20.94,ENG,775,0,0,0,,Oh, we will have much to say to Nancy, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:26.32,ENG,776,0,0,0,,"With this sword, I do...", No! "With..."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.46,0:59:30.12,ENG,777,0,0,0,,"With this sword, I do smote thee!"
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:33.50,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Is "smote" the right word? "Smoot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.63,0:59:35.50,ENG,779,0,0,0,,I don't think that's a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.63,0:59:39.97,ENG,780,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just "smite" him. Let's try this again. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.14,0:59:44.30,ENG,781,0,0,0,,Shrek attacks me. I pretend to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.04,0:59:49.45,ENG,782,0,0,0,,"Now the kingdom will get the happily ever after they deserve. Die, ogre!"
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.58,0:59:53.24,ENG,783,0,0,0,,Blah, blah, blah. Oh, itjust doesn't feel real enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.15,0:59:57.18,ENG,784,0,0,0,,Who told you to stop dancing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.32,0:59:58.79,ENG,785,0,0,0,,Wink and turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.92,1:00:02.15,ENG,786,0,0,0,,What are you laying around for? Get up! Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.83,1:00:14.03,ENG,787,0,0,0,,Our happily ever after is nearly complete, Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.17,1:00:16.37,ENG,788,0,0,0,,And I assure you...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.51,1:00:21.50,ENG,789,0,0,0,,...the people of this kingdom will pay dearly for every second...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.68,1:00:24.34,ENG,790,0,0,0,,...we've had to wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.95,1:00:27.38,ENG,791,0,0,0,,Break a leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.52,1:00:30.28,ENG,792,0,0,0,,On second thought, let me break it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:34.72,ENG,793,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. I was afraid you wouldn't get back in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.86,1:00:36.49,ENG,794,0,0,0,,Where's Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:40.86,ENG,795,0,0,0,,Don't worry. She and the others are safe... for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.04,1:00:53.37,ENG,796,0,0,0,,Let me guess. Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.04,1:00:56.07,ENG,797,0,0,0,,It's Artie, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.21,1:01:01.21,ENG,798,0,0,0,,This boy is supposed to be the new King of Far Far Away?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.12,1:01:04.42,ENG,799,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.55,1:01:07.42,ENG,800,0,0,0,,Stand still, so I won't make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.56,1:01:10.99,ENG,801,0,0,0,,Oharming, stop! I'm here now. You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.13,1:01:12.79,ENG,802,0,0,0,,This isn't about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.56,1:01:17.90,ENG,803,0,0,0,,Then who's it about? I'm supposed to be king, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.24,1:01:23.61,ENG,804,0,0,0,,You weren't really next in line for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.74,1:01:25.14,ENG,805,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.28,1:01:28.61,ENG,806,0,0,0,,But you said the King asked for me personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.75,1:01:30.58,ENG,807,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.71,1:01:32.15,ENG,808,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.28,1:01:34.77,ENG,809,0,0,0,,I said whatever I had to say, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.92,1:01:38.62,ENG,810,0,0,0,,I wasn't right for the job, so I needed some fool to replace me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.76,1:01:42.42,ENG,811,0,0,0,,And you fit the bill. So just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.50,1:01:47.55,ENG,812,0,0,0,,You were playing me the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.70,1:01:49.46,ENG,813,0,0,0,,You catch on real fast, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:52.69,ENG,814,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not as big of a loser as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.11,1:02:01.48,ENG,815,0,0,0,,You know, for a minute...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.61,1:02:03.51,ENG,816,0,0,0,,- I actually thought... - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.65,1:02:07.14,ENG,817,0,0,0,,That he cared about you? He's an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.28,1:02:09.12,ENG,818,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.10,1:02:23.12,ENG,819,0,0,0,,You really do have a way with children, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.48,1:02:39.28,ENG,820,0,0,0,,∮ Leave me out with the waste ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.42,1:02:42.35,ENG,821,0,0,0,,∮ This is not what I do ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.49,1:02:46.18,ENG,822,0,0,0,,∮ It's the wrong time ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.32,1:02:49.02,ENG,823,0,0,0,,∮ She's pulling me through ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.16,1:02:52.86,ENG,824,0,0,0,,∮ It's a small crime ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.00,1:02:55.62,ENG,825,0,0,0,,∮ And I got no excuse ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.77,1:02:58.17,ENG,826,0,0,0,,∮ And is that all right, yeah? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.64,1:03:01.66,ENG,827,0,0,0,,∮ Is that all right with you? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.51,1:03:06.84,ENG,828,0,0,0,,∮ Is that all right, yeah? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.34,1:03:11.34,ENG,829,0,0,0,,∮ If I give my gun away when it's loaded? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.52,1:03:18.18,ENG,830,0,0,0,,∮ If you don't shoot it how am I supposed to hold it? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.36,1:03:24.23,ENG,831,0,0,0,,∮ Is that all right? Is that all right? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.36,1:03:27.80,ENG,832,0,0,0,,∮ Is that all right with you? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.93,1:03:28.40,ENG,833,0,0,0,,∮ No ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.40,1:03:28.80,ENG,834,0,0,0,,∮ No ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.96,ENG,835,0,0,0,,Had we stayed put like I suggested,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.10,1:03:33.90,ENG,836,0,0,0,,we'd be sipping tea out of little heart-shaped cups.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.04,1:03:35.56,ENG,837,0,0,0,,Yeah, heart-shaped cups.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.71,1:03:38.33,ENG,838,0,0,0,,And eating crumpets smothered with loganberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.48,1:03:40.07,ENG,839,0,0,0,,Yeah, loganberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.21,1:03:42.08,ENG,840,0,0,0,,- Shut up, Oindy. - Yeah, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.21,1:03:45.08,ENG,841,0,0,0,,- No, you shut up. - Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.22,1:03:48.01,ENG,842,0,0,0,,Who cares who's "running the kingdom"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.15,1:03:51.38,ENG,843,0,0,0,,- I care. - You should all care.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.36,1:03:58.26,ENG,844,0,0,0,,I have your badge number, tin can!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.40,1:04:00.26,ENG,845,0,0,0,,- Donkey? - Princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:01.39,ENG,846,0,0,0,,Puss?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.53,1:04:05.59,ENG,847,0,0,0,,I am Puss, stuck here inside this hideous body.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.74,1:04:06.76,ENG,848,0,0,0,,And I'm me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.90,1:04:08.03,ENG,849,0,0,0,,But you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.17,1:04:10.83,ENG,850,0,0,0,,Everything's fruity in the loops, but what happened is
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.97,1:04:12.94,ENG,851,0,0,0,,we went to high school, the boat crashed
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.08,1:04:15.64,ENG,852,0,0,0,,and we got bippity-boppity-booped by the magic man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.78,1:04:17.97,ENG,853,0,0,0,,You poor sweet things.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.11,1:04:19.51,ENG,854,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.65,1:04:23.38,ENG,855,0,0,0,,The cat turned into a little horse that smells like feet. What's to get?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:24.89,ENG,856,0,0,0,,Who dat?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:26.05,ENG,857,0,0,0,,Where's Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.19,1:04:30.18,ENG,858,0,0,0,,Oharming has him. He plans to kill Shrek tonight in front of the whole kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.59,1:04:35.76,ENG,859,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. We need to find a way out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.90,1:04:39.43,ENG,860,0,0,0,,You're right. Ladies, assume the position!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.31,1:04:45.50,ENG,861,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.28,1:04:47.64,ENG,862,0,0,0,,Waiting to be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.78,1:04:49.75,ENG,863,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.88,1:04:52.64,ENG,864,0,0,0,,What else can we do? We're just four...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.78,1:04:56.08,ENG,865,0,0,0,,...I mean three, super-hot princesses...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:05:00.28,ENG,866,0,0,0,,...two circus freaks, a pregnant ogre and an old lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.12,1:05:05.46,ENG,867,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Old lady coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:15.87,ENG,868,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.01,1:05:20.27,ENG,869,0,0,0,,You didn't think you got your fighting skills from your father, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.41,1:05:23.14,ENG,870,0,0,0,,Excuse me. There's still one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.32,1:05:35.66,ENG,871,0,0,0,,Why don't you just lie down?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.33,1:05:41.20,ENG,872,0,0,0,,Okay, girls, from here on out...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.33,1:05:43.80,ENG,873,0,0,0,,...we take care of business ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.85,1:06:05.38,ENG,874,0,0,0,,The Far Far Away Theatre at the Charming Pavilion is proud to present...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.52,1:06:07.29,ENG,875,0,0,0,,..."It's A Happily Ever After After AII."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.42,1:06:10.72,ENG,876,0,0,0,,Enjoy your evening of theatrical reverie, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.86,1:06:14.19,ENG,877,0,0,0,,Oi! No food or beverages in the theater!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.04,1:06:29.41,ENG,878,0,0,0,,Places, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.55,1:06:35.68,ENG,879,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.82,1:06:39.72,ENG,880,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was showing off for the little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.46,1:06:44.05,ENG,881,0,0,0,,It's Bring Your Kids to Work Day. Oome here, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.23,1:06:50.22,ENG,882,0,0,0,,Well, she's got your eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.47,1:06:56.41,ENG,883,0,0,0,,Who would have thought a monster like me deserved something as special as you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.08,1:07:41.11,ENG,884,0,0,0,,∮ Little birdies, take wing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.95,1:07:44.58,ENG,885,0,0,0,,∮ Flitting down from the trees they appear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.72,1:07:47.19,ENG,886,0,0,0,,∮ And to chirp in my ear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.46,1:07:51.45,ENG,887,0,0,0,,∮ All because I sing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.09,1:08:22.15,ENG,888,0,0,0,,Move it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.77,1:08:30.49,ENG,889,0,0,0,,My babies!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:32.49,ENG,890,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.05,1:09:20.04,ENG,891,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.73,1:09:32.66,ENG,892,0,0,0,,O to the K. The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.80,1:09:35.42,ENG,893,0,0,0,,Let's do this. Go, Team Dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.57,1:09:39.40,ENG,894,0,0,0,,I thought we agreed to use the name Team Super Oool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.54,1:09:41.77,ENG,895,0,0,0,,I recall it was Team Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:43.84,ENG,896,0,0,0,,I voted for Team Alpha Wolf Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.97,1:09:45.94,ENG,897,0,0,0,,Okay! From henceforth,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.08,1:09:50.21,ENG,898,0,0,0,,we will be Team Alpha Super Awesome Oool Dynamite Wolf Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:54.58,ENG,899,0,0,0,,Ach de liebe! There is some strange little girl over there staring at us!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.52,1:09:56.88,ENG,900,0,0,0,,Artie!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.02,1:09:58.39,ENG,901,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.52,1:10:00.72,ENG,902,0,0,0,,Where is the fire, senor?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.86,1:10:02.88,ENG,903,0,0,0,,Please. Don't act so innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.03,1:10:06.79,ENG,904,0,0,0,,You both knew what was going on and kept it to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.93,1:10:08.52,ENG,905,0,0,0,,It's not like it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.67,1:10:11.50,ENG,906,0,0,0,,It's not? I think it seems pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.63,1:10:14.16,ENG,907,0,0,0,,He was using me. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.30,1:10:16.74,ENG,908,0,0,0,,Using you? You really don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.87,1:10:19.87,ENG,909,0,0,0,,Shrek only said those things to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.54,1:10:25.21,ENG,910,0,0,0,,Oharming was going to kill you, Artie! Shrek saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.79,1:10:37.38,ENG,911,0,0,0,,Oue the spot!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.23,1:10:43.76,ENG,912,0,0,0,,I wait alone up here
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.60,ENG,913,0,0,0,,I'm trapped another day
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:49.93,ENG,914,0,0,0,,Locked up here, please set me free
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.07,1:10:53.10,ENG,915,0,0,0,,My new life I almost see
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:55.94,ENG,916,0,0,0,,A castle, you and me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.08,1:11:01.18,ENG,917,0,0,0,,Yes, a castle, you and me
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.25,1:11:04.31,ENG,918,0,0,0,,Oherubs!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.26,1:11:12.06,ENG,919,0,0,0,,Tis I, Tis I Upon my regal steed
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.20,1:11:13.82,ENG,920,0,0,0,,Princess, my love
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.96,1:11:16.73,ENG,921,0,0,0,,At last you shall be freed I'm strong
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.87,1:11:18.83,ENG,922,0,0,0,,And brave And dashing my way there
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.27,1:11:24.93,ENG,923,0,0,0,,With speed! With might! With soft and bouncy hair!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.91,1:11:29.67,ENG,924,0,0,0,,- Through the blistering desert - Hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.81,1:11:32.84,ENG,925,0,0,0,,- Across the stormiest sea - Wet!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.98,1:11:34.97,ENG,926,0,0,0,,Facing creatures so vile
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:36.24,ENG,927,0,0,0,,Foul!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.39,1:11:40.52,ENG,928,0,0,0,,So you can gaze upon me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.82,1:11:44.16,ENG,929,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come for me
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.29,1:11:48.13,ENG,930,0,0,0,,And now we finally meet
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.26,1:11:49.73,ENG,931,0,0,0,,I knew you'd wait
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.87,1:11:54.39,ENG,932,0,0,0,,And from my plate of love you'd eat
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.32,1:12:17.66,ENG,933,0,0,0,,Who is this terribly ugly fiend Who so rudely intervened?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.79,1:12:19.63,ENG,934,0,0,0,,Will Charming fight or flee?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.76,1:12:20.82,ENG,935,0,0,0,,Please rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.96,1:12:22.66,ENG,936,0,0,0,,From this monstrosity!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.80,1:12:27.83,ENG,937,0,0,0,,Fear thee not, honey lamb! I will slice this thing up like a ham!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.01,1:12:30.47,ENG,938,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.61,1:12:34.20,ENG,939,0,0,0,,You are about to enter a world of pain
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.34,1:12:38.68,ENG,940,0,0,0,,With which you are not familiar!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.12,1:12:46.52,ENG,941,0,0,0,,It can't be any more painful than your lousy performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.19,1:12:52.18,ENG,942,0,0,0,,"Prepare, foul beast."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.30,1:12:57.56,ENG,943,0,0,0,,Prepare, foul beast, your time is done!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.70,1:13:00.86,ENG,944,0,0,0,,Oould you kill me and then sing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.37,1:13:04.07,ENG,945,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.21,1:13:08.34,ENG,946,0,0,0,,I'm just having fun with you. That's actually a very nice leotard.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.48,1:13:09.74,ENG,947,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.88,1:13:11.97,ENG,948,0,0,0,,Do they come in men's sizes?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.05,1:13:16.78,ENG,949,0,0,0,,Now that be funny!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.92,1:13:18.89,ENG,950,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.29,1:13:25.09,ENG,951,0,0,0,,Now you'll finally know what it's like...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.23,1:13:28.76,ENG,952,0,0,0,,...to have everything you worked for...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.90,1:13:32.93,ENG,953,0,0,0,,...everything that's precious to you, taken away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:36.40,ENG,954,0,0,0,,Now you'll know how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.75,1:13:45.41,ENG,955,0,0,0,,Sausage roll!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.77,1:14:05.29,ENG,956,0,0,0,,Pray for mercy from Puss!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.43,1:14:06.92,ENG,957,0,0,0,,And Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.14,1:14:08.19,ENG,958,0,0,0,,（字母D）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.22,1:14:20.48,ENG,959,0,0,0,,Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.62,1:14:23.64,ENG,960,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.79,1:14:26.12,ENG,961,0,0,0,,Much better, now that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.79,1:14:33.99,ENG,962,0,0,0,,So, Oharming, you want to let me out of these so we can settle this ogre-to-man?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.13,1:14:38.46,ENG,963,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds fun. But I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.32,1:14:56.72,ENG,964,0,0,0,,No! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.85,1:15:00.98,ENG,965,0,0,0,,You will not ruin things this time, ogre. Kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.83,1:15:06.59,ENG,966,0,0,0,,Everybody, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.43,1:15:10.52,ENG,967,0,0,0,,Oh, what is it now?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.67,1:15:11.93,ENG,968,0,0,0,,Artie?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.61,1:15:24.08,ENG,969,0,0,0,,Who thinks we need to settle things this way?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.35,1:15:32.05,ENG,970,0,0,0,,You mean you want to be villains your whole lives?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.19,1:15:35.99,ENG,971,0,0,0,,But we are villains! It's the only thing we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.13,1:15:38.56,ENG,972,0,0,0,,You never wish you could be something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.69,1:15:42.15,ENG,973,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say. You're not some evil enchanted tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.30,1:15:45.06,ENG,974,0,0,0,,You morons! Don't listen to him! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.20,1:15:48.00,ENG,975,0,0,0,,What Steve means is it's hard to come by honest work
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.14,1:15:50.16,ENG,976,0,0,0,,when the whole world's against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.31,1:15:52.04,ENG,977,0,0,0,,Right. Thanks, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:56.58,ENG,978,0,0,0,,Fair enough. You're right. I'm not a talking tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.71,1:15:57.80,ENG,979,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.95,1:16:01.08,ENG,980,0,0,0,,...a good friend once told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.22,1:16:06.25,ENG,981,0,0,0,,...just because people treat you like a villain, or an ogre...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.39,1:16:08.38,ENG,982,0,0,0,,...orjust some loser...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.89,1:16:11.79,ENG,983,0,0,0,,...doesn't mean you are one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.66,1:16:18.53,ENG,984,0,0,0,,What matters most is what you think of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.67,1:16:22.97,ENG,985,0,0,0,,If there's something you really want, or someone you want to be...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.11,1:16:26.73,ENG,986,0,0,0,,...the only person standing in your way is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.24,1:16:29.01,ENG,987,0,0,0,,- Me? - Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.15,1:16:30.54,ENG,988,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.68,1:16:33.62,ENG,989,0,0,0,,What I mean is each of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.75,1:16:36.01,ENG,990,0,0,0,,...is standing in your own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.92,1:16:42.41,ENG,991,0,0,0,,I always wanted to play the flute.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.56,1:16:46.22,ENG,992,0,0,0,,I'd like to open up a spa... in France!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.36,1:16:50.92,ENG,993,0,0,0,,I grow daffodils. And they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.65,1:17:42.81,ENG,994,0,0,0,,A new era finally begins!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.65,1:17:46.31,ENG,995,0,0,0,,Now all of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.16,1:17:49.56,ENG,996,0,0,0,,...bow before your King!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.33,ENG,997,0,0,0,,You need to work on your aim.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:03.54,ENG,998,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be my happily ever after!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.67,1:18:06.16,ENG,999,0,0,0,,Well, you need to keep looking...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.18,1:18:10.24,ENG,1000,0,0,0,,...because I'm not giving up mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.52,1:18:16.68,ENG,1001,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.03,1:18:30.19,ENG,1002,0,0,0,,It's yours if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.87,1:18:33.20,ENG,1003,0,0,0,,But this time it's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.89,1:18:56.92,ENG,1004,0,0,0,,Author!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.06,1:19:00.39,ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Artie! Artie! Artie! Artie!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.73,1:19:07.73,ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Excuse me. That's my seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.74,1:19:13.50,ENG,1007,0,0,0,,Okay, Senor Hocusy-Pocusy, the time has come to rectify some wrongs!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.64,1:19:16.17,ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Though I have been enjoying these cat baths.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.31,1:19:17.80,ENG,1009,0,0,0,,Please say you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.95,1:19:19.85,ENG,1010,0,0,0,,All right! Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.98,1:19:23.28,ENG,1011,0,0,0,,You'll feel a pinch and possibly lower intestinal discomfort...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.42,1:19:25.75,ENG,1012,0,0,0,,...but this should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.99,1:19:32.46,ENG,1013,0,0,0,,- Are you? - I'm me again!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.60,1:19:34.86,ENG,1014,0,0,0,,- And I am not you! - All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.43,1:19:37.59,ENG,1015,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.60,1:19:41.00,ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Ah, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.01,1:19:49.07,ENG,1017,0,0,0,,What did I tell you? The kid's going to be a great king.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.21,1:19:52.77,ENG,1018,0,0,0,,Well, for what it's worth, you would have, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.28,1:19:57.28,ENG,1019,0,0,0,,I have something much more important in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.81,1:20:24.04,ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.82,1:20:32.15,ENG,1021,0,0,0,,Dada.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.26,1:20:38.63,ENG,1022,0,0,0,,∮ Was I wrong about the world? It's a beautiful new place ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.76,1:20:41.25,ENG,1023,0,0,0,,I smell Shrek Junior!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.40,1:20:44.06,ENG,1024,0,0,0,,∮ Where else could a creep like me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.20,1:20:46.93,ENG,1025,0,0,0,,∮ Meet such a pretty face ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:51.01,ENG,1026,0,0,0,,∮ Meeting every day with the rising sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.81,1:20:56.71,ENG,1027,0,0,0,,∮ Looking up, it's looking like... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.85,1:20:59.51,ENG,1028,0,0,0,,∮ My losing streak is done ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.42,1:21:01.71,ENG,1029,0,0,0,,∮ Peek-a-boo! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.85,1:21:03.18,ENG,1030,0,0,0,,∮ Peek-a-boo! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.39,1:21:08.22,ENG,1031,0,0,0,,A bouncy, bouncy, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.36,1:21:11.05,ENG,1032,0,0,0,,∮ Used to always feel like ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.19,1:21:13.86,ENG,1033,0,0,0,,∮ Wished that I was dressed better ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.86,1:21:16.52,ENG,1034,0,0,0,,Where's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.67,1:21:21.03,ENG,1035,0,0,0,,∮ Never had a lot of luck Until I finally met her ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.55,1:21:34.54,ENG,1036,0,0,0,,∮ Meeting every day with the rising sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.22,1:21:39.38,ENG,1037,0,0,0,,∮ Looking up, it's looking like... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.06,1:21:42.89,ENG,1038,0,0,0,,∮ My losing streak is done ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.06,1:21:47.39,ENG,1039,0,0,0,,∮ My losing streak is done ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.24,1:22:00.90,ENG,1040,0,0,0,,Well... what shall we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:18.59,ENG,1041,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.10,1:22:29.47,ENG,1042,0,0,0,,∮ Puss and Donkey, baby! Once again, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.61,1:22:34.24,ENG,1043,0,0,0,,∮ I want to thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.38,1:22:35.47,ENG,1044,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.61,1:22:37.48,ENG,1045,0,0,0,,∮ Look at my hips ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.61,1:22:42.81,ENG,1046,0,0,0,,∮ I want to thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.95,1:22:44.44,ENG,1047,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.73,1:22:51.25,ENG,1048,0,0,0,,- ∮ Break it down ∮ - ∮ Let's go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.39,1:22:53.79,ENG,1049,0,0,0,,∮ Stiff all in the collar ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.63,1:22:57.79,ENG,1050,0,0,0,,∮ Fluffy in the face ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.97,1:23:02.46,ENG,1051,0,0,0,,∮ Chit chat chatter trying ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.81,1:23:05.97,ENG,1052,0,0,0,,∮ Stuffy in the place ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.14,1:23:10.98,ENG,1053,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for the par-tay ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.15,1:23:14.01,ENG,1054,0,0,0,,∮ But I could never stay ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.15,1:23:15.48,ENG,1055,0,0,0,,∮ I'm sorry ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.15,1:23:19.14,ENG,1056,0,0,0,,∮ I got many things on my mind ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.49,1:23:22.65,ENG,1057,0,0,0,,∮ But the word's in the way ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.66,1:23:28.86,ENG,1058,0,0,0,,∮ And I want to thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.00,1:23:30.33,ENG,1059,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.33,1:23:33.30,ENG,1060,0,0,0,,∮ Different strokes for different folks ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.44,1:23:37.03,ENG,1061,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.17,1:23:38.66,ENG,1062,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.84,1:23:42.33,ENG,1063,0,0,0,,∮ Break it down ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.35,1:23:46.51,ENG,1064,0,0,0,,∮ Puss and Donkey, baby! Puss and Donkey, baby! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.02,1:23:48.68,ENG,1065,0,0,0,,∮ Puss and Donkey, baby! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.02,1:23:52.18,ENG,1066,0,0,0,,∮ Dance to the music ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.02,1:23:56.35,ENG,1067,0,0,0,,∮ All night long ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:24:00.69,ENG,1068,0,0,0,,∮ Everyday people ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.36,1:24:04.53,ENG,1069,0,0,0,,∮ Sing a simple song ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.54,1:24:09.03,ENG,1070,0,0,0,,∮ Mama's so happy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.87,1:24:12.86,ENG,1071,0,0,0,,∮ Mama start to cry ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.04,1:24:17.53,ENG,1072,0,0,0,,∮ Papa's still singing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.71,1:24:22.21,ENG,1073,0,0,0,,∮ You can make it if you try So try ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:27.25,ENG,1074,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.39,1:24:28.72,ENG,1075,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.73,1:24:35.60,ENG,1076,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.73,1:24:37.43,ENG,1077,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.57,1:24:40.43,ENG,1078,0,0,0,,∮ Oome on, Donkey. Do something right ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.57,1:24:42.97,ENG,1079,0,0,0,,∮ Put the hoofs together! Put the hoofs together! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.07,1:24:48.27,ENG,1080,0,0,0,,∮ Stomp your boots, baby! Stomp your boots, baby! Stomp your boots, baby! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.41,1:24:52.28,ENG,1081,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.41,1:24:53.90,ENG,1082,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.08,1:25:00.61,ENG,1083,0,0,0,,∮ I want to thank you for letting me be myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.76,1:25:01.85,ENG,1084,0,0,0,,∮ Again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.99,1:25:04.96,ENG,1085,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you, thank you, thank you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.09,1:25:08.29,ENG,1086,0,0,0,,∮ Want to thank you Just to be my ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.43,1:25:11.30,ENG,1087,0,0,0,,∮ Because I just want to be my... See? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.43,1:25:14.13,ENG,1088,0,0,0,,∮ Can I, can I thank you! Can I ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.27,1:25:16.10,ENG,1089,0,0,0,,∮ Yes! Yes! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:30.20,CHS,1,0,0,0,,《怪物史瑞克3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:56.71,CHS,1,0,0,0,,冲啊，嫱嬉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.44,CHS,2,0,0,0,,向高塔顶端的房间冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:04.68,CHS,3,0,0,0,,那儿我的公主正等待着 她英俊的查明王子来救她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:19.80,CHS,4,0,0,0,,这比《情书》还难看 我讨厌晚餐剧场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.70,CHS,5,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.03,CHS,6,0,0,0,,就这里，嫱嬉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:29.90,CHS,7,0,0,0,,听！勇敢的查明王子来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:34.42,CHS,8,0,0,0,,不要怕，美女 我会杀死那个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:37.49,CHS,9,0,0,0,,然后正当的坐上王位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.22,CHS,10,0,0,0,,她说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.40,CHS,11,0,0,0,,是史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.33,CHS,12,0,0,0,,史莱克，耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:50.66,CHS,13,0,0,0,,受死吧，恶心的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:55.47,CHS,14,0,0,0,,送你去一个你从没感受过的痛苦世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:58.17,CHS,15,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐 祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:01:59.57,CHS,16,0,0,0,,你介意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:03.08,CHS,17,0,0,0,,你介意吗？无聊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.92,CHS,18,0,0,0,,受死吧，恶心的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.63,CHS,19,0,0,0,,总有一天你会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:23.93,CHS,20,0,0,0,,我们已经后悔了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.36,CHS,21,0,0,0,,妈咪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.79,CHS,22,0,0,0,,你是对的，我不能让这发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:02:59.97,CHS,23,0,0,0,,绝不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.91,CHS,24,0,0,0,,我才是遥远国正当的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:07.14,CHS,25,0,0,0,,我向你保证，母亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:10.21,CHS,26,0,0,0,,我会恢复我王座的尊严
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.91,CHS,27,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:20.22,CHS,28,0,0,0,,没人能够阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.84,CHS,29,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.51,CHS,30,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:44.21,CHS,31,0,0,0,,早晨的呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.51,CHS,32,0,0,0,,我知道，多美妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:50.02,CHS,33,0,0,0,,早上好，早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:53.09,CHS,34,0,0,0,,太阳照屁屁啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.42,CHS,35,0,0,0,,早上好，你也早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.69,CHS,36,0,0,0,,还有你！ 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.30,CHS,37,0,0,0,,他们长得真快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:05.53,CHS,38,0,0,0,,还不够快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:10.30,CHS,39,0,0,0,,你们将即位国王和王后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:13.64,CHS,40,0,0,0,,有几个场合需要你出席，殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:17.08,CHS,41,0,0,0,,太好了！我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:20.05,CHS,42,0,0,0,,拜托，懒骨头 该行动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:23.15,CHS,43,0,0,0,,你真的需要一套睡衣裤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.83,CHS,44,0,0,0,,∮ 我睡了一会儿，我需要它 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.70,CHS,45,0,0,0,,∮ 不是很多，只是一点点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.93,CHS,46,0,0,0,,∮ 总有人想阻止我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.91,CHS,47,0,0,0,,∮ 真丢脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.94,CHS,48,0,0,0,,∮ 这是一种皇家的痛苦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.74,CHS,49,0,0,0,,我封你为爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.73,CHS,50,0,0,0,,如果你想继任国王 你就该表现的像个国王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:15.93,CHS,51,0,0,0,,谁能进来帮史莱克弄一下造型？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.27,CHS,52,0,0,0,,我看看我能怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.13,CHS,53,0,0,0,,耶，哇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:45.46,CHS,54,0,0,0,,这真的有必要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.90,CHS,55,0,0,0,,当然有必要，菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.84,CHS,56,0,0,0,,- 我是史莱克，你个笨蛋 - 管他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:54.67,CHS,57,0,0,0,,好，这不是排练 我们来看看下面的骚动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:56.75,CHS,58,0,0,0,,微笑，各位！微笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.34,CHS,59,0,0,0,,我不知道我还能忍多久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:03.42,CHS,60,0,0,0,,对不起，但你能不能只是露齿一笑 再忍耐一下呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.58,CHS,61,0,0,0,,等到爸爸好转就没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.99,CHS,62,0,0,0,,史莱克？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.92,CHS,63,0,0,0,,你看上去很英俊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.00,CHS,64,0,0,0,,过来，你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:33.01,CHS,65,0,0,0,,我屁股痒的要命 穿了这猴子装我够不到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:36.79,CHS,66,0,0,0,,嘿，你！过来，你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.29,CHS,67,0,0,0,,费斗斯沃斯，殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:40.52,CHS,68,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.56,CHS,69,0,0,0,,女士们先生们…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.86,CHS,70,0,0,0,,有请菲奥娜公主和史莱克殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:54.97,CHS,71,0,0,0,,啊！就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.63,CHS,72,0,0,0,,再左边一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.07,CHS,73,0,0,0,,就是那里，很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.31,CHS,74,0,0,0,,哦，耶，挠，就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.88,CHS,75,0,0,0,,史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:10.92,CHS,76,0,0,0,,我的眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:12.22,CHS,77,0,0,0,,你在干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:19.79,CHS,78,0,0,0,,菲奥娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:26.13,CHS,79,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 嗯，我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.08,CHS,80,0,0,0,,哦，虾，我的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.29,CHS,81,0,0,0,,- 我受够了，我们走！ - 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:50.36,CHS,82,0,0,0,,冷静？你认为我们是在跟谁开玩笑？ 我是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:54.09,CHS,83,0,0,0,,我不适合做这个，菲奥娜 永远都不适合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.54,CHS,84,0,0,0,,我认为会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.90,CHS,85,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.77,CHS,86,0,0,0,,别这样，史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.51,CHS,87,0,0,0,,有些人就是不识相
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:20.39,CHS,88,0,0,0,,想想，再过几天我们就能回家去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:23.83,CHS,89,0,0,0,,回到我们那点缀着菌菇 充满着虫子的小木屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.87,CHS,90,0,0,0,,充满着泥土的气息和懒散
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.63,CHS,91,0,0,0,,你让我好像回到了那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:35.31,CHS,92,0,0,0,,也许地上还有一串小脚印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:38.51,CHS,93,0,0,0,,对，沼泽里的老鼠开始产卵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.01,CHS,94,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:43.84,CHS,95,0,0,0,,我想到的是比沼泽鼠更大一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.01,CHS,96,0,0,0,,驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:48.81,CHS,97,0,0,0,,不，史莱克，假设，理论上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.22,CHS,98,0,0,0,,是小怪物的小脚印？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:02.03,CHS,99,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我们要理智对待这个事情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:04.53,CHS,100,0,0,0,,你最近看到过婴儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:07.87,CHS,101,0,0,0,,他们只会吃然后拉，还有哭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:11.38,CHS,102,0,0,0,,当他们拉的时候哭 哭的时候拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:14.31,CHS,103,0,0,0,,现在，想像一下怪物婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:18.25,CHS,104,0,0,0,,他们哭的更厉害，拉的也更厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:21.98,CHS,105,0,0,0,,史莱克，你从没想过拥有一个家庭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.68,CHS,106,0,0,0,,现在，你就是我的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.86,CHS,107,0,0,0,,那么急干吗，有人要死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.03,CHS,108,0,0,0,,我快要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.53,CHS,109,0,0,0,,哈罗德？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:44.80,CHS,110,0,0,0,,不要忘了付钱给园丁，莉莉安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.88,CHS,111,0,0,0,,当然，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:49.67,CHS,112,0,0,0,,菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:51.34,CHS,113,0,0,0,,在，爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.21,CHS,114,0,0,0,,我知道我过去错怪了你很多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.69,CHS,115,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.95,CHS,116,0,0,0,,但你对史莱克的爱…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.29,CHS,117,0,0,0,,教会了我很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.42,CHS,118,0,0,0,,我亲爱的孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:08.83,CHS,119,0,0,0,,我很自豪称你为我的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:12.10,CHS,120,0,0,0,,我也很自豪称你为我的青蛙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.67,CHS,121,0,0,0,,…国王岳父
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:20.41,CHS,122,0,0,0,,现在有件事要处理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.75,CHS,123,0,0,0,,青蛙国王…死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.90,CHS,124,0,0,0,,戴好你的帽子，傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.63,CHS,125,0,0,0,,史莱克…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:47.43,CHS,126,0,0,0,,请来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.64,CHS,127,0,0,0,,是的，爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:55.94,CHS,128,0,0,0,,王国需要一位新的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:01.95,CHS,129,0,0,0,,你和菲奥娜将即位王座
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.82,CHS,130,0,0,0,,即位？你看，爸爸 这就是为什么人民爱戴你的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:11.29,CHS,131,0,0,0,,即使临终之时，你还在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:18.67,CHS,132,0,0,0,,得了吧，爸爸，怪物做国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.33,CHS,133,0,0,0,,这不是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:24.77,CHS,134,0,0,0,,必须有另外的人来继任，任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:30.11,CHS,135,0,0,0,,除了你，只有一个继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:33.45,CHS,136,0,0,0,,真的？是谁？爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.65,CHS,137,0,0,0,,他叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.08,CHS,138,0,0,0,,叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.85,CHS,139,0,0,0,,他叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.59,CHS,140,0,0,0,,叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.59,CHS,141,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.82,CHS,142,0,0,0,,他叫亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.35,CHS,143,0,0,0,,亚瑟？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:15.69,CHS,144,0,0,0,,我知道你会…处理好这件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.06,CHS,145,0,0,0,,哈罗德？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.76,CHS,146,0,0,0,,爸爸？爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.43,CHS,147,0,0,0,,爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.63,CHS,148,0,0,0,,脱帽，朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:13:00.44,CHS,149,0,0,0,,∮ 当你年轻的时候，你的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.73,CHS,150,0,0,0,,∮ 是一本打开的书 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:08.87,CHS,151,0,0,0,,∮ 你以前常说活着，让活着 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.35,CHS,152,0,0,0,,∮ 你知道你做了，你知道你做了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:18.22,CHS,153,0,0,0,,∮ 但是如果我们生活的这个不断变化的世界 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:23.26,CHS,154,0,0,0,,∮ 让你屈服并哭泣 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:27.93,CHS,155,0,0,0,,∮ 说生与死 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.03,CHS,156,0,0,0,,∮ 生与死 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:13.31,CHS,157,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿，小姐，小姐 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.48,CHS,158,0,0,0,,∮ 诅咒你的生命 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:19.81,CHS,159,0,0,0,,∮ 你是个不满的母亲 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:24.15,CHS,160,0,0,0,,∮ 和一个受约束的妻子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:53.01,CHS,161,0,0,0,,王子想在这儿喝酒该怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:56.05,CHS,162,0,0,0,,啊，梅波
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:15:00.59,CHS,163,0,0,0,,为什么他们叫你丑陋的继姐 我一直不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:04.79,CHS,164,0,0,0,,多丽丝呢？今晚休息？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.70,CHS,165,0,0,0,,这里不欢迎她，你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:12.40,CHS,166,0,0,0,,你想要干吗，查明？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:16.60,CHS,167,0,0,0,,没什么，想找个机会赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.68,CHS,168,0,0,0,,一杯鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.87,CHS,169,0,0,0,,给在场所有我的朋友们一杯鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.95,CHS,170,0,0,0,,我们不是你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.28,CHS,171,0,0,0,,你不属于这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:37.59,CHS,172,0,0,0,,你说得对，但我意思是 有谁属于这里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.36,CHS,173,0,0,0,,在他脸上做个记号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:44.10,CHS,174,0,0,0,,等等，等等 我们其实都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.14,CHS,175,0,0,0,,丑巫婆！七个小矮人救了白雪公主 然后发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:49.37,CHS,176,0,0,0,,这和你有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.77,CHS,177,0,0,0,,他们给了你最不公平的待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:56.44,CHS,178,0,0,0,,现在你在这里 靠台球来换取你的下一顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.41,CHS,179,0,0,0,,那感觉怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.48,CHS,180,0,0,0,,很不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:07.02,CHS,181,0,0,0,,还有你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.79,CHS,182,0,0,0,,你的明星木偶放弃了表演 去寻找他的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.39,CHS,183,0,0,0,,我讨厌那个小木头玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.50,CHS,184,0,0,0,,还有你铁钩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.23,CHS,185,0,0,0,,还需要我说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.71,CHS,186,0,0,0,,- 你，弗朗皮克斯金 - 是兰佩尔斯汀斯金
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.47,CHS,187,0,0,0,,他们保证你的长子又在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:34.79,CHS,188,0,0,0,,梅波，记住你是怎么不能把你的肥脚丫…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:36.82,CHS,189,0,0,0,,穿进那个小的水晶鞋的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:43.02,CHS,190,0,0,0,,灰姑娘此刻正在遥远国…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:48.32,CHS,191,0,0,0,,正吃着糖果和那些
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.80,CHS,192,0,0,0,,和你作对的人快乐着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:55.87,CHS,193,0,0,0,,从前，一些人把我们称为失败者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:58.88,CHS,194,0,0,0,,但每个故事都有两面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:01.57,CHS,195,0,0,0,,我们的那一面还没有讲给人听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:06.58,CHS,196,0,0,0,,所以谁要加入我？谁想要翻身一次？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.38,CHS,197,0,0,0,,谁想要…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.68,CHS,198,0,0,0,,从此以后一直幸福？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.54,CHS,199,0,0,0,,这边，绅士们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:46.92,CHS,200,0,0,0,,人在江湖，身不由己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:50.86,CHS,201,0,0,0,,但我永远不会忘记你 你是我一生的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.43,CHS,202,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.93,CHS,203,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:59.23,CHS,204,0,0,0,,我不认识你，但我也愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.74,CHS,205,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.84,CHS,206,0,0,0,,我也不想离开你们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.81,CHS,207,0,0,0,,但你知道史莱克是怎样的 这兄弟没有我就不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:12.08,CHS,208,0,0,0,,不要担心，我会每天给你快递香吻的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:14.78,CHS,209,0,0,0,,要坚强，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:17.36,CHS,210,0,0,0,,椰子，花生，听妈妈的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:21.48,CHS,211,0,0,0,,香蕉，不要再在你妹妹头上烤蜜饯了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.12,CHS,212,0,0,0,,那才是我的乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:28.36,CHS,213,0,0,0,,都过来，给你们老爸一个大大的拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:36.27,CHS,214,0,0,0,,史莱克？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:41.58,CHS,215,0,0,0,,也许你该留下继任国王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:45.24,CHS,216,0,0,0,,得了吧，我怎么可能来管理国家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:48.38,CHS,217,0,0,0,,你的堂弟亚瑟才是个完美的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:51.05,CHS,218,0,0,0,,不是的，你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:55.65,CHS,219,0,0,0,,如果他给我麻烦 我可以说服他给他讲道理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:59.13,CHS,220,0,0,0,,这法宝是说服力，这法宝是讲道理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:02.93,CHS,221,0,0,0,,菲奥娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:06.33,CHS,222,0,0,0,,很快就只有你和我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.13,CHS,223,0,0,0,,还有我们的沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.47,CHS,224,0,0,0,,不只是你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:15.65,CHS,225,0,0,0,,上船啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.65,CHS,226,0,0,0,,会的，我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.31,CHS,227,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.48,CHS,228,0,0,0,,（我们爱你，爸爸）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:30.59,CHS,229,0,0,0,,太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.32,CHS,230,0,0,0,,再见，孩子们！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.10,CHS,231,0,0,0,,史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.54,CHS,232,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.17,CHS,233,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:52.05,CHS,234,0,0,0,,我也爱你，亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:55.02,CHS,235,0,0,0,,不！我说，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:19:59.46,CHS,236,0,0,0,,你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.03,CHS,237,0,0,0,,我说我怀孕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.67,CHS,238,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.86,CHS,239,0,0,0,,你要做父亲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.50,CHS,240,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.91,CHS,241,0,0,0,,真的？我很高兴你这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.44,CHS,242,0,0,0,,我爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.57,CHS,243,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:24.05,CHS,244,0,0,0,,我也爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:31.41,CHS,245,0,0,0,,我要做叔叔了！ 我要做叔叔了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.62,CHS,246,0,0,0,,你，我的朋友，将成为皇室…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.32,CHS,247,0,0,0,,家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:27.94,CHS,248,0,0,0,,史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.61,CHS,249,0,0,0,,菲奥娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:36.95,CHS,250,0,0,0,,菲奥娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.57,CHS,251,0,0,0,,哦，不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:03.65,CHS,252,0,0,0,,我一直说，能吃下去就别吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.66,CHS,253,0,0,0,,不，不，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.39,CHS,254,0,0,0,,没事的，会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.83,CHS,255,0,0,0,,住手，嘿，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:17.75,CHS,256,0,0,0,,驴子！驴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:19.12,CHS,257,0,0,0,,醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:22.89,CHS,258,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:27.32,CHS,259,0,0,0,,史莱克？你好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:34.60,CHS,260,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我要做父亲了 这怎么发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:38.94,CHS,261,0,0,0,,请允许我解释，当一个男人 对一个女人有感觉时…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:41.60,CHS,262,0,0,0,,一股强大的冲动占据着他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:44.24,CHS,263,0,0,0,,我知道这是怎么发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:47.14,CHS,264,0,0,0,,我只是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.75,CHS,265,0,0,0,,这是怎么发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:04.03,CHS,266,0,0,0,,∮ 还有猫在摇篮里和银勺 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:06.80,CHS,267,0,0,0,,∮ 蓝色小男孩和月亮上的人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:09.53,CHS,268,0,0,0,,∮ 你什么时候回家，儿子？我不知道什么时候 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:11.97,CHS,269,0,0,0,,∮ 但我们到时候会聚在一起的，爸爸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:14.10,CHS,270,0,0,0,,驴子！你能不能只唱…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:16.77,CHS,271,0,0,0,,让我感觉舒服的部分？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:20.04,CHS,272,0,0,0,,你知道我很爱菲奥娜，对吧，老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:24.25,CHS,273,0,0,0,,我要说的是你，我还有我堂弟的船…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:29.99,CHS,274,0,0,0,,再来一壶冰酒，加上两个礼拜的钓鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.13,0:24:31.99,CHS,275,0,0,0,,不要听他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:34.83,CHS,276,0,0,0,,有孩子不会毁掉你的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:39.50,CHS,277,0,0,0,,我担心的不是毁掉我的生活 而是孩子的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:43.94,CHS,278,0,0,0,,你听到过别人说“像怪物一样美”…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.51,CHS,279,0,0,0,,或是”像怪物一样有教养“
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:51.01,CHS,280,0,0,0,,或是”你会喜欢我爸爸的 他是个真正的怪物“这样的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.15,0:24:52.91,CHS,281,0,0,0,,好，我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.05,0:24:56.51,CHS,282,0,0,0,,虽然这不会那么容易 但你有我们的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.35,CHS,283,0,0,0,,那倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.49,0:24:59.96,CHS,284,0,0,0,,命中注定的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:01.75,CHS,285,0,0,0,,你会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:04.56,CHS,286,0,0,0,,你完了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.49,CHS,287,0,0,0,,哦，完…成了你的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:22.11,CHS,288,0,0,0,,”沃…册特…斯里？“ 听上去很新奇！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:23.58,CHS,289,0,0,0,,是沃塞斯特雷
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:25.55,CHS,290,0,0,0,,和那个沙司牌子一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.68,0:25:27.02,CHS,291,0,0,0,,好香！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:32.69,CHS,292,0,0,0,,他们肯定在期待我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:41.40,CHS,293,0,0,0,,这个沃什么的到底是个什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:46.73,CHS,294,0,0,0,,我的胃好疼还有我的手掌在出汗 一定是个中学
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:48.03,CHS,295,0,0,0,,中学？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.17,0:25:49.73,CHS,296,0,0,0,,好了吗？开始
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:52.31,CHS,297,0,0,0,,“你想到达艺术的顶端吗?”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.44,0:25:56.40,CHS,298,0,0,0,,“是啊，我们能，我们能！ 有什么能阻止你呢？”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.55,0:25:59.02,CHS,299,0,0,0,,“不，没有，没有”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.29,0:26:08.28,CHS,300,0,0,0,,好，佩西，脱缰一样冲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:15.33,CHS,301,0,0,0,,伙计，别烧了我的乳香和没药
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:18.96,CHS,302,0,0,0,,那平底鞋和混乱场面让我感到恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:23.77,CHS,303,0,0,0,,你不穿内裤哪来的平底鞋呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.91,0:26:26.81,CHS,304,0,0,0,,有些事是不言而喻的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.95,0:26:31.01,CHS,305,0,0,0,,所以我要说“我宁愿得黑死病 也不愿和你出去约会”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.15,0:26:33.48,CHS,306,0,0,0,,- 哦，绝对的 - 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.62,0:26:36.42,CHS,307,0,0,0,,- 绝对恶心 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.02,0:26:40.62,CHS,308,0,0,0,,我刚把我的角色等级升到了+3超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:43.32,CHS,309,0,0,0,,嗨，我们在找一个叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:47.99,CHS,310,0,0,0,,谁弄了+9的傀儡符咒 又召唤了怪物和四足怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:54.33,CHS,311,0,0,0,,我知道你们很忙没时间 但你们能告诉我哪里能找到亚瑟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.47,0:26:55.77,CHS,312,0,0,0,,他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:20.36,CHS,313,0,0,0,,没有比胜利更美味的了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:25.67,CHS,314,0,0,0,,强壮，英俊，长着一张领导者的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:29.14,CHS,315,0,0,0,,亚瑟长得不就像一位国王吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:31.64,CHS,316,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:35.01,CHS,317,0,0,0,,你刚才说你在找亚瑟？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.58,CHS,318,0,0,0,,显而易见的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.41,CHS,319,0,0,0,,这是顶级机密！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.55,0:27:43.15,CHS,320,0,0,0,,先生们，我们走 去洗澡！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:47.28,CHS,321,0,0,0,,你好，陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:48.98,CHS,322,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.92,CHS,323,0,0,0,,你是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.06,0:27:55.33,CHS,324,0,0,0,,某种变异的巨大妖精还是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:59.83,CHS,325,0,0,0,,变异？你真搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.34,0:28:02.27,CHS,326,0,0,0,,放我下来，怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:04.38,CHS,327,0,0,0,,不要动，亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:06.84,CHS,328,0,0,0,,我不是亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:11.37,CHS,329,0,0,0,,我是兰斯洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.18,CHS,330,0,0,0,,那边的那个傻瓜才是亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:22.45,CHS,331,0,0,0,,这…真的是…很尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.59,0:28:25.19,CHS,332,0,0,0,,但蒂凡尼对你很有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.33,0:28:28.73,CHS,333,0,0,0,,她想你会不会愿意邀请她去“回归舞会”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:29.96,CHS,334,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.10,0:28:34.04,CHS,335,0,0,0,,这样的，她对大学男生 还有神话怪物很感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:39.57,CHS,336,0,0,0,,哦，亚瑟…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.71,0:28:43.41,CHS,337,0,0,0,,出来，出来，不管你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.45,0:28:48.08,CHS,338,0,0,0,,你们最好走远点，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:51.62,CHS,339,0,0,0,,贫嘴驴短内裤的日子结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.06,CHS,340,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:01.79,CHS,341,0,0,0,,我们是来参加吉祥物比赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.47,0:29:09.67,CHS,342,0,0,0,,我们也是来参加吉祥物比赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.81,0:29:12.33,CHS,343,0,0,0,,这是服装吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:14.47,CHS,344,0,0,0,,我弄了整整一晚上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.81,0:29:17.61,CHS,345,0,0,0,,看上去象真的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:20.15,CHS,346,0,0,0,,如果他是真的，我能这样做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.82,0:29:23.48,CHS,347,0,0,0,,或是这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.76,0:29:29.63,CHS,348,0,0,0,,如果是真的，早就疼得要命了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.96,CHS,349,0,0,0,,- 看好这个！ - 够了，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:38.43,CHS,350,0,0,0,,谢谢普林波顿教授和他的“只要说不”演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:43.64,CHS,351,0,0,0,,现在不再啰唆，让我们热烈…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:47.27,CHS,352,0,0,0,,欢迎吉祥物大赛的冠军…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:49.44,CHS,353,0,0,0,,怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:53.81,CHS,354,0,0,0,,对，我是新的吉祥物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.95,0:29:57.58,CHS,355,0,0,0,,我们还是热烈的为那些…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:30:00.85,CHS,356,0,0,0,,不知道在干吗的人鼓掌吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:07.39,CHS,357,0,0,0,,这太不正统了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:11.20,CHS,358,0,0,0,,哪里我能找到亚瑟·潘德拉根？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:14.96,CHS,359,0,0,0,,嘿，等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:20.70,CHS,360,0,0,0,,经典
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:22.54,CHS,361,0,0,0,,你该为自己感到羞愧！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:25.08,CHS,362,0,0,0,,不是我干的，是他们干的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:31.62,CHS,363,0,0,0,,请不要吃掉我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.76,0:30:34.09,CHS,364,0,0,0,,吃掉他！吃掉他！吃掉他！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.76,CHS,365,0,0,0,,我不是来吃他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.23,0:30:41.86,CHS,366,0,0,0,,你该打包整理你的行李了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.00,0:30:44.23,CHS,367,0,0,0,,你将是遥远国新的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.37,0:30:46.03,CHS,368,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:51.77,CHS,369,0,0,0,,亚蒂王？ 他更像是笨蛋村的村长！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:57.50,CHS,370,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:02.25,CHS,371,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:06.79,CHS,372,0,0,0,,当然，清理好你的衣柜，孩子 你的王国等着你管理
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:09.59,CHS,373,0,0,0,,等等…我真的是唯一的继承人？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.93,0:31:12.26,CHS,374,0,0,0,,唯一的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:15.26,CHS,375,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:19.26,CHS,376,0,0,0,,我的人民…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.40,0:31:22.13,CHS,377,0,0,0,,这是非常好的一课
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:26.57,CHS,378,0,0,0,,下一次你们准备把一个小孩的头 泡在尿壶里的时候，请停下想想
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.71,0:31:29.20,CHS,379,0,0,0,,“嘿，也许这个家伙也是有感情的”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:32.31,CHS,380,0,0,0,,“也许我该放他一马”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.45,0:31:35.82,CHS,381,0,0,0,,“也许因为…也许…”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:39.65,CHS,382,0,0,0,,“这家伙会成为，有可能，成为国王？”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.79,0:31:44.82,CHS,383,0,0,0,,也许他颁布的第一个皇家法令就是 放逐那些曾经戏弄过他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:47.83,CHS,384,0,0,0,,我在看着你，骑马队！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.17,0:31:51.36,CHS,385,0,0,0,,还有奎因？哦，奎因
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.57,CHS,386,0,0,0,,我一直爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.44,0:31:58.00,CHS,387,0,0,0,,好朋友们，我很伤心，但…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:32:01.64,CHS,388,0,0,0,,你们继续享受在这牢狱里的日子吧 而我将去统治一个自由的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:03.37,CHS,389,0,0,0,,好了，我们不要搞的太过了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:06.85,CHS,390,0,0,0,,我将建立我的城市，摇滚的人民
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.99,0:32:08.85,CHS,391,0,0,0,,你做得太过了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:19.62,CHS,392,0,0,0,,看看你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.77,0:32:21.29,CHS,393,0,0,0,,你看上去真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:23.63,CHS,394,0,0,0,,太尊贵了，看她
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:26.14,CHS,395,0,0,0,,从你怀孕后有什么特别渴望的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.27,0:32:28.90,CHS,396,0,0,0,,没，一点也没
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.74,0:32:31.47,CHS,397,0,0,0,,你们闻到火腿的味道了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.61,0:32:34.74,CHS,398,0,0,0,,现在是礼物时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:40.68,CHS,399,0,0,0,,菲奥娜，请先打开我的礼物 前面的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:45.45,CHS,400,0,0,0,,“恭喜你要有调皮鬼了” 哦，调皮鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:48.58,CHS,401,0,0,0,,“希望这对你有用，爱你的，灰姑娘”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.93,0:32:51.59,CHS,402,0,0,0,,- 看看那个！ - 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.17,0:32:55.63,CHS,403,0,0,0,,用来打扫大便的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.77,0:32:57.33,CHS,404,0,0,0,,等等…婴儿的大便？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.47,0:32:58.80,CHS,405,0,0,0,,每个人都大便的，睡美人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.94,0:33:00.40,CHS,406,0,0,0,,菲奥娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.37,CHS,407,0,0,0,,我们也都准备了一个小礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.28,0:33:05.83,CHS,408,0,0,0,,哒…哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.05,0:33:09.88,CHS,409,0,0,0,,你知道孩子会喜欢的 因为我也喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:12.98,CHS,410,0,0,0,,伙计们，你们真是太好了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.52,CHS,411,0,0,0,,这是谁给的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.65,0:33:17.59,CHS,412,0,0,0,,我给你最大的礼物 因为爱你也最深
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:20.78,CHS,413,0,0,0,,“我也想有个，爱你的，白雪公主”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.63,0:33:25.26,CHS,414,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:26.92,CHS,415,0,0,0,,专职婴儿保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:28.16,CHS,416,0,0,0,,宝宝在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.30,0:33:32.36,CHS,417,0,0,0,,你太好了，白雪公主 但我不能收下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.50,0:33:34.87,CHS,418,0,0,0,,没什么的，我家里还有6个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:36.77,CHS,419,0,0,0,,- 他能做什么？ - 打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.91,0:33:38.50,CHS,420,0,0,0,,- 喂饭 - 打嗝
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.64,0:33:41.11,CHS,421,0,0,0,,那我和史莱克该干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:43.37,CHS,422,0,0,0,,享受你们的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:47.38,CHS,423,0,0,0,,谢谢，莴苣姑娘 那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.52,0:33:51.55,CHS,424,0,0,0,,得了，菲奥娜 你知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.49,0:33:54.52,CHS,425,0,0,0,,你一直很劳累
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.66,0:33:56.39,CHS,426,0,0,0,,失去了真正的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:57.69,CHS,427,0,0,0,,妊娠纹
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.83,0:33:59.16,CHS,428,0,0,0,,再也没有浪漫生活
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:04.94,CHS,429,0,0,0,,不好意思，但你们中有几个有孩子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.07,0:34:06.63,CHS,430,0,0,0,,她说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.77,0:34:11.21,CHS,431,0,0,0,,孩子只会加深史莱克和菲奥娜之间的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:14.18,CHS,432,0,0,0,,当你告诉史莱克时，他是什么反应？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.35,0:34:18.51,CHS,433,0,0,0,,当他第一次知道时，他说…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:35.70,CHS,434,0,0,0,,冲啊，我的新朋友们！ 为了我们永远的幸福生活！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.37,0:34:43.53,CHS,435,0,0,0,,现在，投弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.06,0:35:02.93,CHS,436,0,0,0,,好，好，好，如果这不是皮特·潘
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:05.53,CHS,437,0,0,0,,- 他不叫皮特 - 闭嘴，温迪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:27.75,CHS,438,0,0,0,,掠夺够了！向城堡冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.57,CHS,439,0,0,0,,你们快走！照顾好孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.71,0:35:50.87,CHS,440,0,0,0,,大家冷静！我们要死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:35:57.41,CHS,441,0,0,0,,大家快进去！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.55,0:35:59.68,CHS,442,0,0,0,,快，撞开！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:04.51,CHS,443,0,0,0,,我们没时间了，快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:06.45,CHS,444,0,0,0,,快点，女士们！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:10.29,CHS,445,0,0,0,,我们尽量拖延住他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.98,0:36:28.38,CHS,446,0,0,0,,史莱克和菲奥娜在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.51,0:36:30.67,CHS,447,0,0,0,,从没听说过这名字
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.82,0:36:32.51,CHS,448,0,0,0,,没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.65,0:36:36.02,CHS,449,0,0,0,,我建议你们这群蠢蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:38.75,CHS,450,0,0,0,,好好的跟遥远国的新国王合作！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.89,0:36:42.59,CHS,451,0,0,0,,你唯一可以成为的是傻瓜国的国王！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.73,0:36:45.03,CHS,452,0,0,0,,- 铁钩！ - 在！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.16,0:36:47.39,CHS,453,0,0,0,,来吧，你这小饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.00,0:36:51.66,CHS,454,0,0,0,,说话呀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:57.53,CHS,455,0,0,0,,- 金吉！ - 爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.04,CHS,456,0,0,0,,大家坐下！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.02,0:37:16.32,CHS,457,0,0,0,,坐上漂亮船去买棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.46,0:37:19.90,CHS,458,0,0,0,,去糖果店的旅程真是太美好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.03,0:37:21.02,CHS,459,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:24.06,CHS,460,0,0,0,,你不会说谎的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.20,0:37:27.87,CHS,461,0,0,0,,告诉我，木偶…史莱克在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.88,0:37:34.11,CHS,462,0,0,0,,那…我不知道他不在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.44,CHS,463,0,0,0,,你不知道史莱克在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.58,0:37:39.18,CHS,464,0,0,0,,不能不正确的假定…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.32,0:37:43.58,CHS,465,0,0,0,,我不能确切的不说出 或部分不几乎是不正确
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.72,0:37:45.09,CHS,466,0,0,0,,那你肯定是知道他在哪里！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:47.75,CHS,467,0,0,0,,恰恰相反，我可能或多或少
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:53.92,CHS,468,0,0,0,,不确定的不完全否定这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:55.05,CHS,469,0,0,0,,住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.33,CHS,470,0,0,0,,我不知道他不应该在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.47,0:37:59.94,CHS,471,0,0,0,,如果确实那不是他不在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.67,CHS,472,0,0,0,,即使他不是不在我所知道的他在的地方 这意味着…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:06.04,CHS,473,0,0,0,,坐上漂亮的船去买棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.18,0:38:10.58,CHS,474,0,0,0,,够了！史莱克出去要把下一任的国王带回来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.59,0:38:15.38,CHS,475,0,0,0,,他要带回下一任的国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.52,0:38:17.01,CHS,476,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:21.45,CHS,477,0,0,0,,铁钩！去除掉这个新“国王”
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:23.46,CHS,478,0,0,0,,但把史莱克带来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:26.79,CHS,479,0,0,0,,我给他准备了特别的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.93,0:38:29.09,CHS,480,0,0,0,,他绝不会被你的诡计陷害的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.77,0:38:32.43,CHS,481,0,0,0,,哦，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:45.31,CHS,482,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信，我，一个国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.45,0:38:48.48,CHS,483,0,0,0,,我知道我出身皇室，但…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:50.71,CHS,484,0,0,0,,我原以为大家都忘记了我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.86,0:38:54.59,CHS,485,0,0,0,,哦，不，实际上是国王亲自点名要你继任的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.73,0:38:57.29,CHS,486,0,0,0,,真的？哇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.63,0:39:00.86,CHS,487,0,0,0,,但我知道这不是玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:03.99,CHS,488,0,0,0,,事实上这确实是玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:07.73,CHS,489,0,0,0,,当然，你要册封一些新英雄 启航一两艘舰船
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:12.21,CHS,490,0,0,0,,顺便说一下，你务必确保 能用瓶子击中轮船
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.34,0:39:15.14,CHS,491,0,0,0,,任何傻瓜都能用一个瓶子击中一艘轮船
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.98,0:39:18.92,CHS,492,0,0,0,,我听说这其实要比看上去来的困难
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:21.02,CHS,493,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:26.02,CHS,494,0,0,0,,聚会，公主，城堡，公主
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:29.02,CHS,495,0,0,0,,你会生活的很奢侈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:31.63,CHS,496,0,0,0,,最好的厨师会等候你的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.76,0:39:34.73,CHS,497,0,0,0,,幸运的是，你还会有皇家食物品尝师
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.56,CHS,498,0,0,0,,他们是做什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:41.30,CHS,499,0,0,0,,在国王吃东西前先品尝 确保食物没有被放毒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.44,0:39:44.03,CHS,500,0,0,0,,- 放毒？ - 或者太咸了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.18,0:39:47.70,CHS,501,0,0,0,,不要担心，你的侍卫会保护你的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.85,0:39:50.11,CHS,502,0,0,0,,他们愿意随时随地的牺牲自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.25,0:39:53.08,CHS,503,0,0,0,,为了保护你的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.22,0:39:54.65,CHS,504,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.79,0:39:57.81,CHS,505,0,0,0,,整个国家都指望着你的智慧和指引
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.19,0:40:00.12,CHS,506,0,0,0,,确保他们不会死于饥饿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:01.99,CHS,507,0,0,0,,- 或是瘟疫 - 瘟疫太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:05.03,CHS,508,0,0,0,,咳嗽，呻吟，化脓溃疡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.60,0:40:11.04,CHS,509,0,0,0,,化脓溃疡！ 你真是个有趣的可爱小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:13.10,CHS,510,0,0,0,,我刚才说什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.24,0:40:15.60,CHS,511,0,0,0,,我们不想让亚蒂有错误的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.37,0:40:17.53,CHS,512,0,0,0,,亚蒂？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.81,0:40:23.58,CHS,513,0,0,0,,够郁闷的！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.72,0:40:25.88,CHS,514,0,0,0,,亚蒂！你在干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.82,0:40:29.95,CHS,515,0,0,0,,你看我在干吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.62,0:40:35.09,CHS,516,0,0,0,,这真的不是你该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.23,0:40:38.09,CHS,517,0,0,0,,我对于当国王一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:40.16,CHS,518,0,0,0,,你会慢慢学会的！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.07,0:40:44.59,CHS,519,0,0,0,,不好意思，但我准备回去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:47.17,CHS,520,0,0,0,,回去哪里？去当一个失败者？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.74,0:40:52.30,CHS,521,0,0,0,,看看你做的好事！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:56.91,CHS,522,0,0,0,,看看我做的好事？ 是谁在掌舵啊，大幅？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.92,0:40:59.41,CHS,523,0,0,0,,史莱克！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.76,0:41:13.75,CHS,524,0,0,0,,上岸！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:28.11,CHS,525,0,0,0,,真是丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:32.05,CHS,526,0,0,0,,哦，做得好，殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.18,0:41:35.88,CHS,527,0,0,0,,现在成了“殿下”？ 刚才谁在叫“失败者”？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:38.92,CHS,528,0,0,0,,如果你认为这就能使你离开 那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.06,0:41:42.82,CHS,529,0,0,0,,我们无论如何会回到遥远国
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.96,0:41:45.40,CHS,530,0,0,0,,而你将会成为父亲！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.53,0:41:46.96,CHS,531,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.80,0:41:49.36,CHS,532,0,0,0,,你刚才说“父亲”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:52.23,CHS,533,0,0,0,,国王！你将会成为国王！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.37,0:41:55.36,CHS,534,0,0,0,,“你会成为国王”是啊，对的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.57,0:41:58.01,CHS,535,0,0,0,,你去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.14,0:42:00.61,CHS,536,0,0,0,,远远…的离开你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.75,0:42:02.71,CHS,537,0,0,0,,回来，年轻人！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.68,0:42:07.17,CHS,538,0,0,0,,老大？我认为他不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.32,0:42:10.52,CHS,539,0,0,0,,也许这是对的 他真的不是当国王的料
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.66,0:42:13.89,CHS,540,0,0,0,,那你计划什么时候告诉他 你才应该当国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:16.86,CHS,541,0,0,0,,得了，我为什么要那么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.00,0:42:20.06,CHS,542,0,0,0,,而且，他做国王比我强十倍
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:24.16,CHS,543,0,0,0,,如果你想要他跟你走 你需要改变你的战略
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.50,0:42:28.34,CHS,544,0,0,0,,你说得对，驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:32.20,CHS,545,0,0,0,,这个怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.34,0:42:36.18,CHS,546,0,0,0,,- 史莱克！ - 得了，只是个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.75,0:42:39.08,CHS,547,0,0,0,,算是吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.87,0:42:57.53,CHS,548,0,0,0,,听着，亚蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.10,0:43:03.23,CHS,549,0,0,0,,如果你觉得这整件事情很糟糕 我理解你，兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.37,0:43:07.50,CHS,550,0,0,0,,我不想难为你，让你心烦意乱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.65,0:43:09.77,CHS,551,0,0,0,,但我想要说的是，你…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.91,0:43:13.11,CHS,552,0,0,0,,想想这整个事情，孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.25,0:43:15.34,CHS,553,0,0,0,,如果这不合理，或是我所说的…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:18.42,CHS,554,0,0,0,,不够真诚，你可以直接说 “哦，不，你别”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.56,0:43:20.99,CHS,555,0,0,0,,“你快让我疯了”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.13,0:43:24.12,CHS,556,0,0,0,,那么我会知道这是… 知道这是不值得的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.73,0:43:26.92,CHS,557,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.07,0:43:30.47,CHS,558,0,0,0,,我被一个怪物绑架了 他想跟我拉关系
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:34.23,CHS,559,0,0,0,,- 亚蒂，等等 - 快点！救命！有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.74,0:43:39.44,CHS,560,0,0,0,,大家好，宇宙的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.58,0:43:41.51,CHS,561,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的宁静之处
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.65,0:43:45.78,CHS,562,0,0,0,,请不要带坏的电颤琴到康复小屋里来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.92,0:43:47.75,CHS,563,0,0,0,,现在准备好…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.42,0:43:56.26,CHS,564,0,0,0,,我就知道我该拿保修单的！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.16,0:44:00.63,CHS,565,0,0,0,,梅林先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.77,0:44:02.23,CHS,566,0,0,0,,你认识这个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.37,0:44:06.63,CHS,567,0,0,0,,是啊，他没神经失常前 是学校里的魔法老师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.77,0:44:10.14,CHS,568,0,0,0,,专业点讲，我只是3等疲劳
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.27,0:44:12.37,CHS,569,0,0,0,,在我的理疗师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.51,0:44:16.14,CHS,570,0,0,0,,和学校方面要求下 我退休来享受宁静世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:18.44,CHS,571,0,0,0,,为了发现我神圣的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.95,0:44:23.35,CHS,572,0,0,0,,谁有兴趣来点小吃或是饮料吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:24.58,CHS,573,0,0,0,,哦，不了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:28.06,CHS,574,0,0,0,,你确定不想尝尝我的烤脆皮面包？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:32.43,CHS,575,0,0,0,,是有机的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.56,0:44:35.00,CHS,576,0,0,0,,谢谢了，我来的途中吃了一大块圆石
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.13,0:44:38.07,CHS,577,0,0,0,,我们需要去遥远国的线路
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:40.73,CHS,578,0,0,0,,“我们”？谁说我要和你一起去？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.87,0:44:45.24,CHS,579,0,0,0,,我说的，人民指望着你 所以不要再躲避了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.38,0:44:47.44,CHS,580,0,0,0,,如果那份差事真的那么好，你去做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.98,0:44:52.25,CHS,581,0,0,0,,你要明白，孩子 现在再也没有什么好人了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.38,0:44:54.68,CHS,582,0,0,0,,他就是你的所谓好人？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.82,0:44:56.75,CHS,583,0,0,0,,是的，我会想念他的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.89,0:45:01.29,CHS,584,0,0,0,,为什么你不自己去恐吓村庄 别管我！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:05.95,CHS,585,0,0,0,,那就是怪物的爆发吗？ 在我没发飙前…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.10,0:45:10.12,CHS,586,0,0,0,,你最好给我回遥远国去当国王 我该怎么发飙？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.27,0:45:12.10,CHS,587,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你，但由于你…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:14.76,CHS,588,0,0,0,,正处于自我毁灭的怒火漩涡之中
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.91,0:45:17.43,CHS,589,0,0,0,,告诉你是不负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.58,0:45:21.24,CHS,590,0,0,0,,自我毁灭？ 你帮不帮我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.38,0:45:23.97,CHS,591,0,0,0,,肯定帮，但只有在你…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.12,0:45:27.31,CHS,592,0,0,0,,进行了心灵之旅后！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.45,0:45:28.82,CHS,593,0,0,0,,我不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.95,0:45:32.79,CHS,594,0,0,0,,要么就是这个，要么就进行心理治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.86,0:45:37.52,CHS,595,0,0,0,,好的，心灵之旅
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:40.23,CHS,596,0,0,0,,现在，你们所有人…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:42.89,CHS,597,0,0,0,,都给我注视着这真理之火
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.03,0:45:46.03,CHS,598,0,0,0,,然后告诉我你们看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:50.74,CHS,599,0,0,0,,哦，手势猜谜游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.88,0:45:55.64,CHS,600,0,0,0,,好，我看到了一个有肉桂卷的荷兰软糖馅饼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.78,0:45:58.37,CHS,601,0,0,0,,好，怪物，该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.06,0:46:08.75,CHS,602,0,0,0,,我看到了一匹彩虹小马
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.89,0:46:10.83,CHS,603,0,0,0,,做得好！该你了，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.96,0:46:12.43,CHS,604,0,0,0,,这太废了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:14.83,CHS,605,0,0,0,,你才废！快试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.40,0:46:17.73,CHS,606,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.57,0:46:23.01,CHS,607,0,0,0,,有一个小鸟还有个鸟爸爸，坐在鸟巢里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.14,0:46:25.13,CHS,608,0,0,0,,好！继续！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.98,0:46:29.97,CHS,609,0,0,0,,爸爸飞走了，他为什么单独留下了小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.65,0:46:34.08,CHS,610,0,0,0,,小鸟试着飞行，但它不会飞
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.99,0:46:37.15,CHS,611,0,0,0,,它要掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.99,0:46:45.99,CHS,612,0,0,0,,你还真是个疯子 一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.33,0:46:54.33,CHS,613,0,0,0,,好，我懂了，小鸟是我 我爸爸离开了，那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.35,0:47:09.01,CHS,614,0,0,0,,听着，亚蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.36,0:47:16.12,CHS,615,0,0,0,,只是想给你们制造…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.26,0:47:19.59,CHS,616,0,0,0,,美好的心对心谈话的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.04,0:47:31.37,CHS,617,0,0,0,,我知道对于一件事还没准备好 是一种什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.71,0:47:36.04,CHS,618,0,0,0,,即使怪物也会觉得担心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.88,0:47:39.71,CHS,619,0,0,0,,你知道…偶尔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.72,0:47:45.49,CHS,620,0,0,0,,我知道你要我成为国王，但我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.62,0:47:48.49,CHS,621,0,0,0,,我不适合当国王，而且永远也不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.39,0:47:51.88,CHS,622,0,0,0,,即使我亲身父亲也觉得我一无是处
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.03,0:47:55.23,CHS,623,0,0,0,,他第一时间把我扔到了那个学校
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.90,0:47:58.23,CHS,624,0,0,0,,我就再也没有听到过他的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.90,0:48:03.74,CHS,625,0,0,0,,我爸爸也不配做父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.40,CHS,626,0,0,0,,我怀疑他比我的爸爸还差
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:08.54,CHS,627,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.68,0:48:12.74,CHS,628,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个怪物，他想吃掉我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.58,0:48:15.78,CHS,629,0,0,0,,我猜我本该意识到的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.92,0:48:20.19,CHS,630,0,0,0,,他拿烧烤调味酱给我洗澡 拿苹果塞着我的嘴放我在床上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.09,0:48:24.58,CHS,631,0,0,0,,我想那真是太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:29.13,CHS,632,0,0,0,,这也许很难相信…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.27,0:48:32.72,CHS,633,0,0,0,,我那显而易见迷人漂亮的外貌…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.87,0:48:35.81,CHS,634,0,0,0,,但在过去一直认为我是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.94,0:48:39.60,CHS,635,0,0,0,,曾经一度，我也相信了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.61,0:48:43.20,CHS,636,0,0,0,,但后来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.35,0:48:46.87,CHS,637,0,0,0,,你学会了忽视别人怎么称呼你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.02,0:48:49.35,CHS,638,0,0,0,,只要相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.46,0:48:54.62,CHS,639,0,0,0,,你知道的，你人很好，史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.46,0:48:59.02,CHS,640,0,0,0,,你只要稍微减少大吼的次数 多用用肥皂就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:01.99,CHS,641,0,0,0,,谢谢，亚蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.13,0:49:05.80,CHS,642,0,0,0,,肥皂是因为你发臭时…真的是太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.97,0:49:09.46,CHS,643,0,0,0,,是啊，我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.48,0:49:16.34,CHS,644,0,0,0,,这地方真是太脏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.65,0:49:18.24,CHS,645,0,0,0,,我感觉自己像是个流浪汉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:22.25,CHS,646,0,0,0,,不好意思，但这地方让我很难受
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.39,0:49:26.95,CHS,647,0,0,0,,你只关心你自己 你的态度不能对我们有任何帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.09,0:49:30.79,CHS,648,0,0,0,,也许是我被选为国家最美的 这一事实打击了你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.93,0:49:33.02,CHS,649,0,0,0,,你是说那次作弊的选美？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:36.13,CHS,650,0,0,0,,得了吧，“莴苣姑娘 莴苣姑娘…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.27,0:49:39.40,CHS,651,0,0,0,,放下你的金色假发！”
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.54,0:49:44.34,CHS,652,0,0,0,,女士们，不要再相互抱怨了 我们要齐心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.31,0:49:50.30,CHS,653,0,0,0,,我猜这计划就是我们毫无目的的…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:52.54,CHS,654,0,0,0,,在这臭气熏天的洞里闲逛直到我们腐烂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.68,0:49:56.21,CHS,655,0,0,0,,不，我们要进去，去探明查明的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.35,0:49:59.05,CHS,656,0,0,0,,我知道他是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.19,0:50:03.35,CHS,657,0,0,0,,但查明真是性感
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.70,0:50:06.03,CHS,658,0,0,0,,就是那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.06,0:50:36.42,CHS,659,0,0,0,,快点！这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.56,0:50:37.55,CHS,660,0,0,0,,莴苣，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.07,0:50:48.90,CHS,661,0,0,0,,查明，放开她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:51.67,CHS,662,0,0,0,,我为什么要那么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.21,0:50:58.20,CHS,663,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.35,0:51:03.45,CHS,664,0,0,0,,女士们，向你们遥远国的新女皇问好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.46,0:51:09.26,CHS,665,0,0,0,,莴苣，你怎么能这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.39,0:51:11.66,CHS,666,0,0,0,,妒忌吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.80,0:51:14.23,CHS,667,0,0,0,,很快你就会回到当初…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.37,0:51:16.99,CHS,668,0,0,0,,你擦地板，被锁在塔楼里的时代了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.13,0:51:20.76,CHS,669,0,0,0,,我会让你在这里多呆一个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.07,0:51:25.67,CHS,670,0,0,0,,波齐，你答应过不伤害他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.81,0:51:29.80,CHS,671,0,0,0,,等会儿，宝贝，我们晚点再说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:33.07,CHS,672,0,0,0,,见谅，我们要去赶演出
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.22,0:51:36.48,CHS,673,0,0,0,,史莱克很快就回来了 你会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.62,0:51:38.02,CHS,674,0,0,0,,后悔？！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.16,0:51:42.42,CHS,675,0,0,0,,你没意识到只要 史莱克一涉足遥远国…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:44.32,CHS,676,0,0,0,,他就完蛋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.87,0:52:25.49,CHS,677,0,0,0,,当心！他们有钢琴！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.64,0:52:29.00,CHS,678,0,0,0,,把他们全杀了…除了那个胖的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.14,0:52:33.51,CHS,679,0,0,0,,查明国王有特殊的主意留给你，怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.64,0:52:34.94,CHS,680,0,0,0,,查明国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:36.10,CHS,681,0,0,0,,攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.39,0:52:43.55,CHS,682,0,0,0,,亚蒂，蹲下！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.10,0:52:59.36,CHS,683,0,0,0,,准备好木板！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.09,0:53:16.75,CHS,684,0,0,0,,- 史莱克！ - 救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.07,0:53:37.37,CHS,685,0,0,0,,冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.51,0:53:39.87,CHS,686,0,0,0,,查明把菲奥娜怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.01,0:53:42.60,CHS,687,0,0,0,,她已经束手就擒了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.18,0:53:48.08,CHS,688,0,0,0,,你已经无能为力去救她了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.22,0:53:50.74,CHS,689,0,0,0,,- 我们必须去救她 - 但我们离她太远了！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.69,0:53:53.99,CHS,690,0,0,0,,你自己回沃塞斯特雷吧，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.12,0:53:57.62,CHS,691,0,0,0,,不，史莱克，等等 我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.76,0:54:00.03,CHS,692,0,0,0,,我是个嗡嗡小蜜蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.70,0:54:03.90,CHS,693,0,0,0,,梅林先生？他们需要一个符咒…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:07.06,CHS,694,0,0,0,,我是说我们需要回到遥远国
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.20,0:54:10.64,CHS,695,0,0,0,,没门，我没有那种魔法能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.77,0:54:14.47,CHS,696,0,0,0,,拥抱一下怎样？ 那是最好的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.61,0:54:16.98,CHS,697,0,0,0,,梅林先生，求你了 我知道你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:18.91,CHS,698,0,0,0,,我说了没门！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.05,0:54:20.38,CHS,699,0,0,0,,但…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:29.38,CHS,700,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:33.89,CHS,701,0,0,0,,这太难受了，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:38.70,CHS,702,0,0,0,,他们需要回去 因为他们的国家正面临困境
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.84,0:54:41.36,CHS,703,0,0,0,,因为那里有个坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.51,0:54:43.27,CHS,704,0,0,0,,这太伤心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.41,0:54:45.53,CHS,705,0,0,0,,好了，别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:49.04,CHS,706,0,0,0,,不！我想你肯定不理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.18,0:54:53.71,CHS,707,0,0,0,,有个卑鄙的家伙正对 一群好人做着卑鄙的事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:55.55,CHS,708,0,0,0,,发发慈悲吧，老人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.69,0:54:59.85,CHS,709,0,0,0,,他们真的需要你帮助他们回去 为什么你不愿帮他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.69,0:55:05.29,CHS,710,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:07.42,CHS,711,0,0,0,,我去拿我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.20,0:55:11.39,CHS,712,0,0,0,,小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.54,0:55:15.06,CHS,713,0,0,0,,那你想要点火腿鸡蛋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.21,0:55:18.90,CHS,714,0,0,0,,我有点生疏了，因此这可能造成些副作用
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.04,0:55:20.51,CHS,715,0,0,0,,- 副作用？ - 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.64,0:55:24.41,CHS,716,0,0,0,,不管什么副作用，无论这有多么痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.55,0:55:27.71,CHS,717,0,0,0,,我想最终这副作用会慢慢消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.69,0:55:31.92,CHS,718,0,0,0,,- 哦，不 - 你确信？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.06,0:55:36.19,CHS,719,0,0,0,,如果亚蒂相信他，那我也肯定相信
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.33,0:55:38.19,CHS,720,0,0,0,,即使他的长袍没有盖住…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.33,0:55:40.85,CHS,721,0,0,0,,[咒语] 玛咪玛咪！轰！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.00,0:55:43.69,CHS,722,0,0,0,,[咒语] 啊…儒咪！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.83,0:55:46.67,CHS,723,0,0,0,,让我们，帮我们的朋友快…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.41,0:55:50.74,CHS,724,0,0,0,,回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.08,0:55:59.67,CHS,725,0,0,0,,起作用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:11.42,CHS,726,0,0,0,,自从大学后我就再也没经历过那种旅程了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.86,0:56:13.12,CHS,727,0,0,0,,驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:16.10,CHS,728,0,0,0,,什么？我牙齿里有什么东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.54,0:56:23.53,CHS,729,0,0,0,,哦，不！我被咒语弄成了那个二流伙伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.88,0:56:29.94,CHS,730,0,0,0,,至少你看起来不像是某种臃肿的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.08,0:56:32.14,CHS,731,0,0,0,,你该考虑一下减肥！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:36.88,CHS,732,0,0,0,,你该给自己弄条内裤 我感觉全都暴露了，很下流！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.56,0:56:40.89,CHS,733,0,0,0,,你们两个认为这很有趣吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.39,0:56:45.19,CHS,734,0,0,0,,我真的抱歉，伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.33,0:56:47.80,CHS,735,0,0,0,,没关系，你把我们弄回来了，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:55.60,CHS,736,0,0,0,,在安徒生童话里…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.74,0:56:58.50,CHS,737,0,0,0,,我也是该穿着这笨重的靴子到处走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.64,0:57:01.48,CHS,738,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿！小心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.91,0:57:06.25,CHS,739,0,0,0,,他们出自马德里最好的…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:08.91,CHS,740,0,0,0,,你会学会怎么控制这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.82,0:57:16.82,CHS,741,0,0,0,,真的，哦！你需要些安慰或是支持
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:27.87,CHS,742,0,0,0,,小心，我走在这儿 并且将一直走下去直到…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.01,0:57:29.10,CHS,743,0,0,0,,匹诺曹！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.84,0:57:31.87,CHS,744,0,0,0,,史莱克！救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:35.21,CHS,745,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了？ - 查明和那些恶棍占领了这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.35,0:57:39.11,CHS,746,0,0,0,,菲奥娜和公主们走了 现在她…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.25,0:57:40.77,CHS,747,0,0,0,,她怎么了？怎么了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.12,0:57:44.95,CHS,748,0,0,0,,小猫，借我5块硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.09,0:57:47.32,CHS,749,0,0,0,,你听到了，帮他出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.46,0:57:49.55,CHS,750,0,0,0,,你看到我身上有口袋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.69,0:57:51.52,CHS,751,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.03,0:57:58.20,CHS,752,0,0,0,,我没办法，真的，我…我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.37,0:58:01.56,CHS,753,0,0,0,,快！菲奥娜在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.71,0:58:05.47,CHS,754,0,0,0,,查明把她关在了什么地方 你必须找到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:08.48,CHS,755,0,0,0,,他可能正在准备演出！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.61,0:58:10.94,CHS,756,0,0,0,,等等，匹诺曹！什么演出？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.95,0:58:18.35,CHS,757,0,0,0,,“从此以后过着幸福快乐的生活”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.82,CHS,758,0,0,0,,“史莱克的最后演出”？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.96,0:58:25.09,CHS,759,0,0,0,,史莱克！你没告诉我们你会在演出里出现
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.23,0:58:28.69,CHS,760,0,0,0,,我想我真是太忙了，忘了提到了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.83,0:58:30.39,CHS,761,0,0,0,,是那个怪物！抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.74,0:58:34.07,CHS,762,0,0,0,,别担心，老大，我来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.61,0:58:42.24,CHS,763,0,0,0,,杀了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.25,0:58:48.38,CHS,764,0,0,0,,听着，难道你们不知道他是谁吗？ 你们怎么敢！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:50.04,CHS,765,0,0,0,,真是些土人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:55.12,CHS,766,0,0,0,,他是个明星，朋友们！哈罗？ 我很抱歉，史莱克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.26,0:58:56.78,CHS,767,0,0,0,,我要生气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.93,0:59:00.73,CHS,768,0,0,0,,都准备好了吗？你得到更衣室的名单了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.86,0:59:03.96,CHS,769,0,0,0,,早餐是塞有生切金枪鱼片的牛角面包
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.10,0:59:07.40,CHS,770,0,0,0,,我希望你吃带有蜂蜜黄油的谷物
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.54,0:59:10.53,CHS,771,0,0,0,,我们的名人没有蜂蜜黄油的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.67,0:59:12.47,CHS,772,0,0,0,,会达不到好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.61,0:59:14.01,CHS,773,0,0,0,,我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.78,0:59:17.30,CHS,774,0,0,0,,他们该和人力的南希谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.45,0:59:20.94,CHS,775,0,0,0,,哦，我保证我们有很多话要告诉南希
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:26.32,CHS,776,0,0,0,,“用这把剑，我…”，不
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.46,0:59:30.12,CHS,777,0,0,0,,“用这把剑，我将击倒你！”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:33.50,CHS,778,0,0,0,,“击倒”这个词对吗？“击到”？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.63,0:59:35.50,CHS,779,0,0,0,,我不认为有这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.63,0:59:39.97,CHS,780,0,0,0,,也许我该“击倒”他，我们再试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.14,0:59:44.30,CHS,781,0,0,0,,史莱克攻击我，我假装害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.04,0:59:49.45,CHS,782,0,0,0,,“现在这个国家将从此得到他们应得的幸福 去死吧，怪物！”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.58,0:59:53.24,CHS,783,0,0,0,,哦，感觉不够真实！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.15,0:59:57.18,CHS,784,0,0,0,,谁要求你停止跳舞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.32,0:59:58.79,CHS,785,0,0,0,,眨眼，转圈
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.92,1:00:02.15,CHS,786,0,0,0,,你躺在那里干吗？起来！老实点！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.83,1:00:14.03,CHS,787,0,0,0,,我们从此以后的幸福就要实现了，妈咪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.17,1:00:16.37,CHS,788,0,0,0,,我向你保证…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.51,1:00:21.50,CHS,789,0,0,0,,这个国家的每个人会为 我们等待的每一秒…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.68,1:00:24.34,CHS,790,0,0,0,,付出代价
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.95,1:00:27.38,CHS,791,0,0,0,,断腿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.52,1:00:30.28,CHS,792,0,0,0,,再想想，还是我来弄断你条腿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:34.72,CHS,793,0,0,0,,谢天谢地，我还以为你不会及时回来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.86,1:00:36.49,CHS,794,0,0,0,,菲奥娜在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:40.86,CHS,795,0,0,0,,不要担心，她和其他的人都很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.04,1:00:53.37,CHS,796,0,0,0,,我猜猜，亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.04,1:00:56.07,CHS,797,0,0,0,,事实上是叫亚蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.21,1:01:01.21,CHS,798,0,0,0,,这孩子就是遥远国的新国王？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.12,1:01:04.42,CHS,799,0,0,0,,多悲哀啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.55,1:01:07.42,CHS,800,0,0,0,,不要动，我才不会手发抖
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.56,1:01:10.99,CHS,801,0,0,0,,查明，住手！我在这里 你得到了你想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.13,1:01:12.79,CHS,802,0,0,0,,这和他没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.56,1:01:17.90,CHS,803,0,0,0,,那和谁有关？ 我才应该是国王，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.24,1:01:23.61,CHS,804,0,0,0,,你其实不是下一任王座的继承人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.74,1:01:25.14,CHS,805,0,0,0,,我才是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.28,1:01:28.61,CHS,806,0,0,0,,但你说过国王亲自点名要我继任
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.75,1:01:30.58,CHS,807,0,0,0,,不完全正确
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.71,1:01:32.15,CHS,808,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.28,1:01:34.77,CHS,809,0,0,0,,该说的我都说了，好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.92,1:01:38.62,CHS,810,0,0,0,,我不适合这个位置 因此需要某个傻瓜来代替我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.76,1:01:42.42,CHS,811,0,0,0,,而你正好合适，你走吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.50,1:01:47.55,CHS,812,0,0,0,,原来你一直在耍我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.70,1:01:49.46,CHS,813,0,0,0,,你理解的很快，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:52.69,CHS,814,0,0,0,,也许你不是我想像中的那么失败
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.11,1:02:01.48,CHS,815,0,0,0,,你知道，曾经一度…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.61,1:02:03.51,CHS,816,0,0,0,,- 我真的以为… - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.65,1:02:07.14,CHS,817,0,0,0,,他在意你？他是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.28,1:02:09.12,CHS,818,0,0,0,,你期盼什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.10,1:02:23.12,CHS,819,0,0,0,,对付孩子你可真有一套啊，史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.48,1:02:39.28,CHS,820,0,0,0,,∮ 把我和废物放在外面 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.42,1:02:42.35,CHS,821,0,0,0,,∮ 这不是我做的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.49,1:02:46.18,CHS,822,0,0,0,,∮ 时间不对 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.32,1:02:49.02,CHS,823,0,0,0,,∮ 她在帮我渡过难关 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.16,1:02:52.86,CHS,824,0,0,0,,∮ 这是个小犯罪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.00,1:02:55.62,CHS,825,0,0,0,,∮ 我没有借口 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.77,1:02:58.17,CHS,826,0,0,0,,∮ 这样行吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.64,1:03:01.66,CHS,827,0,0,0,,∮ 你觉得可以吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.51,1:03:06.84,CHS,828,0,0,0,,∮ 可以吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.34,1:03:11.34,CHS,829,0,0,0,,∮ 如果上膛后我把枪给别人？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.52,1:03:18.18,CHS,830,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你不开枪，我怎么拿着它？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.36,1:03:24.23,CHS,831,0,0,0,,∮ 可以吗？这样行吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.36,1:03:27.80,CHS,832,0,0,0,,∮ 你同意吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.93,1:03:28.40,CHS,833,0,0,0,,∮ 不！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.40,1:03:28.80,CHS,834,0,0,0,,∮ 不！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.96,CHS,835,0,0,0,,要是我们像我说的呆在原处不动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.10,1:03:33.90,CHS,836,0,0,0,,我们现在就正拿着心形杯喝茶呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.04,1:03:35.56,CHS,837,0,0,0,,是啊，是啊，心形杯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.71,1:03:38.33,CHS,838,0,0,0,,吃着带罗甘莓的煎饼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.48,1:03:40.07,CHS,839,0,0,0,,是啊，罗甘莓
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.21,1:03:42.08,CHS,840,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴，辛迪 - 是啊，闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.21,1:03:45.08,CHS,841,0,0,0,,- 不，你闭嘴 - 少管闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.22,1:03:48.01,CHS,842,0,0,0,,谁在乎谁来掌管国家？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.15,1:03:51.38,CHS,843,0,0,0,,- 我关心 - 你们都该关心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.36,1:03:58.26,CHS,844,0,0,0,,我记住你们的徽章编号了，铁罐！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.40,1:04:00.26,CHS,845,0,0,0,,- 驴子？ - 公主！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:01.39,CHS,846,0,0,0,,猫咪？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.53,1:04:05.59,CHS,847,0,0,0,,我才是猫咪，粘在了这个丑恶的身体里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.74,1:04:06.76,CHS,848,0,0,0,,我才是我！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.90,1:04:08.03,CHS,849,0,0,0,,但你是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.17,1:04:10.83,CHS,850,0,0,0,,一切都糟透了，事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.97,1:04:12.94,CHS,851,0,0,0,,我们去了中学，船撞毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.08,1:04:15.64,CHS,852,0,0,0,,然后我们一个魔法师施了魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.78,1:04:17.97,CHS,853,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.11,1:04:19.51,CHS,854,0,0,0,,我没明白
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.65,1:04:23.38,CHS,855,0,0,0,,这只猫变成了闻起来像臭脚的驴子 什么不明白的？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:24.89,CHS,856,0,0,0,,谁死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:26.05,CHS,857,0,0,0,,史莱克呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.19,1:04:30.18,CHS,858,0,0,0,,查明抓住了他，他计划 今晚在整个国家面前杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.59,1:04:35.76,CHS,859,0,0,0,,好了，各位，我们需要找到条出去的路
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.90,1:04:39.43,CHS,860,0,0,0,,你说的对，女士们，各就各位
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.31,1:04:45.50,CHS,861,0,0,0,,你们在干吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.28,1:04:47.64,CHS,862,0,0,0,,等着被救
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.78,1:04:49.75,CHS,863,0,0,0,,你在开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.88,1:04:52.64,CHS,864,0,0,0,,我们还能怎么做呢？我们只是四个…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.78,1:04:56.08,CHS,865,0,0,0,,我是说三个漂亮的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:05:00.28,CHS,866,0,0,0,,两个马戏团小丑，一个怀孕的怪物 还有个老太婆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.12,1:05:05.46,CHS,867,0,0,0,,不好意思，老太婆要爆发了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:15.87,CHS,868,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.01,1:05:20.27,CHS,869,0,0,0,,你认为你没有从你父亲那里 学到了战斗技巧，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.41,1:05:23.14,CHS,870,0,0,0,,不好意思，我想那还有一面墙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.32,1:05:35.66,CHS,871,0,0,0,,你先躺下休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.33,1:05:41.20,CHS,872,0,0,0,,好了，女士们，从这里出去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.33,1:05:43.80,CHS,873,0,0,0,,我们自己管好自己
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.85,1:06:05.38,CHS,874,0,0,0,,先生们女士们，查明阁下的 遥远国剧场将隆重呈现…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.52,1:06:07.29,CHS,875,0,0,0,,“从此以后过着幸福快乐的生活”
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.42,1:06:10.72,CHS,876,0,0,0,,市民们，享受这梦幻般的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.86,1:06:14.19,CHS,877,0,0,0,,剧场里不允许吃零食和饮料
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.04,1:06:29.41,CHS,878,0,0,0,,各就各位！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.55,1:06:35.68,CHS,879,0,0,0,,轻点！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.82,1:06:39.72,CHS,880,0,0,0,,对不起，我想跟小家伙炫耀一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.46,1:06:44.05,CHS,881,0,0,0,,带了孩子来上班，过来，美女
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.23,1:06:50.22,CHS,882,0,0,0,,她继承了你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.47,1:06:56.41,CHS,883,0,0,0,,谁会想到像我这种怪物 能拥有像你一样特别的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.08,1:07:41.11,CHS,884,0,0,0,,∮ 小鸟，飞翔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.95,1:07:44.58,CHS,885,0,0,0,,∮ 从它们出现的树上飞下来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.72,1:07:47.19,CHS,886,0,0,0,,∮ 在我耳边唧唧喳喳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.46,1:07:51.45,CHS,887,0,0,0,,∮ 都是因为我唱歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.09,1:08:22.15,CHS,888,0,0,0,,冲啊！冲！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.77,1:08:30.49,CHS,889,0,0,0,,我的孩子们！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:32.49,CHS,890,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.05,1:09:20.04,CHS,891,0,0,0,,嘿，怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.73,1:09:32.66,CHS,892,0,0,0,,O到K，危险已经全部清除
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.80,1:09:35.42,CHS,893,0,0,0,,我们行动吧，出去，摧毁小队
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.57,1:09:39.40,CHS,894,0,0,0,,我认为我们已经同意了 使用超级无敌酷这个小队名字
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.54,1:09:41.77,CHS,895,0,0,0,,我记得是叫帅气小队
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:43.84,CHS,896,0,0,0,,我投票选了阿尔法狼中队
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.97,1:09:45.94,CHS,897,0,0,0,,好了，好了！从此以后
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.08,1:09:50.21,CHS,898,0,0,0,,我们就是阿尔法超级帅气无敌摧毁狼中队
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:54.58,CHS,899,0,0,0,,那边有个奇怪的陌生小女孩盯着我们看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.52,1:09:56.88,CHS,900,0,0,0,,亚蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.02,1:09:58.39,CHS,901,0,0,0,,等等，等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.52,1:10:00.72,CHS,902,0,0,0,,你的怒火呢，先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.86,1:10:02.88,CHS,903,0,0,0,,拜托，别装的那么无辜
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.03,1:10:06.79,CHS,904,0,0,0,,你从一开始就知道怎么回事 却一直没说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.93,1:10:08.52,CHS,905,0,0,0,,事情并不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.67,1:10:11.50,CHS,906,0,0,0,,不是那样？我认为已经很清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.63,1:10:14.16,CHS,907,0,0,0,,他在利用我，就是那么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.30,1:10:16.74,CHS,908,0,0,0,,利用你？你真的没明白
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.87,1:10:19.87,CHS,909,0,0,0,,史莱克是为了保护你才这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.54,1:10:25.21,CHS,910,0,0,0,,不然查明会杀了你的，亚蒂！ 史莱克救了你的命
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.79,1:10:37.38,CHS,911,0,0,0,,灯光对准！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.23,1:10:43.76,CHS,912,0,0,0,,我孤独在这儿等待
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.60,CHS,913,0,0,0,,被关了又一天
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:49.93,CHS,914,0,0,0,,被锁在这里，请让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.07,1:10:53.10,CHS,915,0,0,0,,我的新生活我快看见
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:55.94,CHS,916,0,0,0,,一个城堡，你和我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.08,1:11:01.18,CHS,917,0,0,0,,是的，一个城堡，你和我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.25,1:11:04.31,CHS,918,0,0,0,,天使！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.26,1:11:12.06,CHS,919,0,0,0,,是的，我在我的帝王战马上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.20,1:11:13.82,CHS,920,0,0,0,,公主，我的爱
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.96,1:11:16.73,CHS,921,0,0,0,,最终你会自由的 我很强壮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.87,1:11:18.83,CHS,922,0,0,0,,很勇敢，正赶来救你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.27,1:11:24.93,CHS,923,0,0,0,,用我的速度！用我的力量！ 用我那柔软有弹性的头发！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.91,1:11:29.67,CHS,924,0,0,0,,- 穿过恶劣的沙漠 - 炎热！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.81,1:11:32.84,CHS,925,0,0,0,,- 渡过狂暴的大海 - 潮湿！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.98,1:11:34.97,CHS,926,0,0,0,,面对如此恶劣的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:36.24,CHS,927,0,0,0,,恶心！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.39,1:11:40.52,CHS,928,0,0,0,,这样你就有机会注视着我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.82,1:11:44.16,CHS,929,0,0,0,,我知道你会来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.29,1:11:48.13,CHS,930,0,0,0,,现在我们终于见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.26,1:11:49.73,CHS,931,0,0,0,,我知道你会等
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.87,1:11:54.39,CHS,932,0,0,0,,会接受我的爱
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.32,1:12:17.66,CHS,933,0,0,0,,这个丑陋的魔鬼是谁？ 谁敢如此粗鲁的来干涉？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.79,1:12:19.63,CHS,934,0,0,0,,查明会战斗还是逃跑？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.76,1:12:20.82,CHS,935,0,0,0,,请救我！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.96,1:12:22.66,CHS,936,0,0,0,,救我离开这个怪物！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.80,1:12:27.83,CHS,937,0,0,0,,你别怕，亲爱的！ 我会把这怪物切成肉片
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.01,1:12:30.47,CHS,938,0,0,0,,哦，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.61,1:12:34.20,CHS,939,0,0,0,,你将进入一个你…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.34,1:12:38.68,CHS,940,0,0,0,,从未感受过的痛苦世界
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.12,1:12:46.52,CHS,941,0,0,0,,没有比你的拙劣表演更痛苦的了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.19,1:12:52.18,CHS,942,0,0,0,,“受死吧，恶心的怪物”
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.30,1:12:57.56,CHS,943,0,0,0,,受死吧，恶心的怪物，你的死期已到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.70,1:13:00.86,CHS,944,0,0,0,,你能不能先杀了我然后再唱？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.37,1:13:04.07,CHS,945,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.21,1:13:08.34,CHS,946,0,0,0,,我只是和你开玩笑 那真是个漂亮的连衣裤
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.48,1:13:09.74,CHS,947,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.88,1:13:11.97,CHS,948,0,0,0,,是照男人的尺寸来做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.05,1:13:16.78,CHS,949,0,0,0,,真好笑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.92,1:13:18.89,CHS,950,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.29,1:13:25.09,CHS,951,0,0,0,,现在你终于知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.23,1:13:28.76,CHS,952,0,0,0,,对你来说宝贵的东西被夺走…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.90,1:13:32.93,CHS,953,0,0,0,,是一种什么感觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:36.40,CHS,954,0,0,0,,现在你会知道我是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.75,1:13:45.41,CHS,955,0,0,0,,香肠卷
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.77,1:14:05.29,CHS,956,0,0,0,,祈求猫咪的仁慈吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.43,1:14:06.92,CHS,957,0,0,0,,还有驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.14,1:14:08.19,CHS,958,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.22,1:14:20.48,CHS,959,0,0,0,,嗨，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.62,1:14:23.64,CHS,960,0,0,0,,对不起，我们来晚了，你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.79,1:14:26.12,CHS,961,0,0,0,,你在这里好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.79,1:14:33.99,CHS,962,0,0,0,,那么，查明，你想放开我 让我们进行真正的怪物对男人的决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.13,1:14:38.46,CHS,963,0,0,0,,哦，那听上去很有趣 但我有个更好的主意
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.32,1:14:56.72,CHS,964,0,0,0,,不！放开我！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.85,1:15:00.98,CHS,965,0,0,0,,这次不会让你毁了一切的，怪物 杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.83,1:15:06.59,CHS,966,0,0,0,,大家，住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.43,1:15:10.52,CHS,967,0,0,0,,哦，又是什么？！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.67,1:15:11.93,CHS,968,0,0,0,,亚蒂？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.61,1:15:24.08,CHS,969,0,0,0,,谁说我们必须要以这种方式解决问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.35,1:15:32.05,CHS,970,0,0,0,,你们想一生都做恶棍吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.19,1:15:35.99,CHS,971,0,0,0,,但我们就是恶棍！ 这是我们唯一所明白的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.13,1:15:38.56,CHS,972,0,0,0,,你从没希望做别的什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.69,1:15:42.15,CHS,973,0,0,0,,你说的容易，你又不是给施了魔法的树
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.30,1:15:45.06,CHS,974,0,0,0,,你个蠢人！别听他的！攻击！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.20,1:15:48.00,CHS,975,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫的意思是如果全世界都讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.14,1:15:50.16,CHS,976,0,0,0,,那么很难得到好工作
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.31,1:15:52.04,CHS,977,0,0,0,,对的，谢谢，爱德
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:56.58,CHS,978,0,0,0,,很公平，你说的对 我不是棵会说话的树
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.71,1:15:57.80,CHS,979,0,0,0,,但你要知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.95,1:16:01.08,CHS,980,0,0,0,,一个好朋友曾经告诉我…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.22,1:16:06.25,CHS,981,0,0,0,,别人对待你像对待恶棍…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.39,1:16:08.38,CHS,982,0,0,0,,或是怪物，或者像对待一个失败者
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.89,1:16:11.79,CHS,983,0,0,0,,这并不意味你就是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.66,1:16:18.53,CHS,984,0,0,0,,最重要的是你自己怎么看你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.67,1:16:22.97,CHS,985,0,0,0,,如果有什么你真的想要的 或是你想成为的…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.11,1:16:26.73,CHS,986,0,0,0,,唯一能阻拦你的就是你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.24,1:16:29.01,CHS,987,0,0,0,,- 我自己？ - 抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.15,1:16:30.54,CHS,988,0,0,0,,不，不，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.68,1:16:33.62,CHS,989,0,0,0,,我的意思是你们每个人…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.75,1:16:36.01,CHS,990,0,0,0,,都有自己的路
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.92,1:16:42.41,CHS,991,0,0,0,,我一直想演奏长笛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.56,1:16:46.22,CHS,992,0,0,0,,我想要在法国开个温泉浴场
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.36,1:16:50.92,CHS,993,0,0,0,,我想种水仙花，很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.65,1:17:42.81,CHS,994,0,0,0,,一个新的时代终于来临了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.65,1:17:46.31,CHS,995,0,0,0,,现在你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.16,1:17:49.56,CHS,996,0,0,0,,向你们的国王鞠躬！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.33,CHS,997,0,0,0,,你需要练习一下瞄准
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:03.54,CHS,998,0,0,0,,这本该是我的幸福生活！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.67,1:18:06.16,CHS,999,0,0,0,,那我想你需要继续寻找了…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.18,1:18:10.24,CHS,1000,0,0,0,,因为我不会放弃我的幸福生活
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.52,1:18:16.68,CHS,1001,0,0,0,,妈咪？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.03,1:18:30.19,CHS,1002,0,0,0,,如果你想要就给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.87,1:18:33.20,CHS,1003,0,0,0,,但这次你自己选择
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.89,1:18:56.92,CHS,1004,0,0,0,,亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.06,1:19:00.39,CHS,1005,0,0,0,,亚蒂！亚蒂！亚蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.73,1:19:07.73,CHS,1006,0,0,0,,不好意思，那是我的座位
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.74,1:19:13.50,CHS,1007,0,0,0,,好了，大魔法师先生 现在是时候纠正错误了！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.64,1:19:16.17,CHS,1008,0,0,0,,尽管我很享受猫的沐浴
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.31,1:19:17.80,CHS,1009,0,0,0,,请说你不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.95,1:19:19.85,CHS,1010,0,0,0,,好的！听着
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.98,1:19:23.28,CHS,1011,0,0,0,,你们可能会感到被掐了一下 也许还会肠子不舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.42,1:19:25.75,CHS,1012,0,0,0,,但这应该有效
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.99,1:19:32.46,CHS,1013,0,0,0,,- 是你吗？ - 我又变回我自己啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.60,1:19:34.86,CHS,1014,0,0,0,,- 我不再是你啦！ - 好啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.43,1:19:37.59,CHS,1015,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.60,1:19:41.00,CHS,1016,0,0,0,,啊，没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.01,1:19:49.07,CHS,1017,0,0,0,,我怎么告诉你的？ 这孩子会成为一个伟大的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.21,1:19:52.77,CHS,1018,0,0,0,,确实，你本来也会是的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.28,1:19:57.28,CHS,1019,0,0,0,,我心里还有更重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.81,1:20:24.04,CHS,1020,0,0,0,,最终
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.82,1:20:32.15,CHS,1021,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.26,1:20:38.63,CHS,1022,0,0,0,,∮ 我对世界的看法错了吗？这是一个美丽的新地方 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.76,1:20:41.25,CHS,1023,0,0,0,,嘿嘿，我闻到了小史莱克的味道！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.40,1:20:44.06,CHS,1024,0,0,0,,∮ 还有什么地方能像我这样的怪物 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.20,1:20:46.93,CHS,1025,0,0,0,,∮ 遇到这么一张漂亮的脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:51.01,CHS,1026,0,0,0,,∮ 每天与日出相遇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.81,1:20:56.71,CHS,1027,0,0,0,,∮ 抬头看，就像... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.85,1:20:59.51,CHS,1028,0,0,0,,∮ 我的连胜结束了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.42,1:21:01.71,CHS,1029,0,0,0,,∮ 藏猫猫 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.85,1:21:03.18,CHS,1030,0,0,0,,∮ 藏猫猫 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.39,1:21:08.22,CHS,1031,0,0,0,,跳啊，跳，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.36,1:21:11.05,CHS,1032,0,0,0,,∮ 以前总觉得 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.19,1:21:13.86,CHS,1033,0,0,0,,∮ 希望我穿得更好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.86,1:21:16.52,CHS,1034,0,0,0,,婴儿在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.67,1:21:21.03,CHS,1035,0,0,0,,∮ 直到最后遇到她，我才有很多运气 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.55,1:21:34.54,CHS,1036,0,0,0,,∮ 每天与日出相遇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.22,1:21:39.38,CHS,1037,0,0,0,,∮ 抬头看，就像 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.06,1:21:42.89,CHS,1038,0,0,0,,∮ 我的连胜结束了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.06,1:21:47.39,CHS,1039,0,0,0,,∮ 我的连胜结束了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.24,1:22:00.90,CHS,1040,0,0,0,,那…我们现在该干吗呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:18.59,CHS,1041,0,0,0,,我来吧
